(1405343, 180204, 30861, '<td valign="top">VERY nice light capture, marred by lack of visual acuity. A great mood. The colors seem shifted to a dull cyan/green tint, a little work with selective color might have done wonders.</td>', 'VERY nice light capture, marred by lack of visual acuity. A great mood. The colors seem shifted to a dull cyan/green tint, a little work with selective color might have done wonders.', '2005-05-23 03:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
