(1405547, 180798, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the sharpness here, but there are several things that bother me about this image - her hands look unnaturally huge, and her leg that is in the foreground looks uncomfortable. I would prefer that she was gazing into the "oracle" or looking more directly into the camera - as it is, she looks half asleep.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the sharpness here, but there are several things that bother me about this image - her hands look unnaturally huge, and her leg that is in the foreground looks uncomfortable. I would prefer that she was gazing into the "oracle" or looking more directly into the camera - as it is, she looks half asleep.', '2005-05-23 08:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
