(1405577, 180667, 35044, '<td valign="top">You must obtain the permission of the station supervisor before taking any photos of the underground...  how often has that tap on my shoulder ruined a good long exposure.  <br/> <br/>Very nice image.  I like the slightly unfocussed and grainy quality - a real black &amp; white feel to this.  It feels as though the image is spiralling.  9.</td>', 'You must obtain the permission of the station supervisor before taking any photos of the underground...  how often has that tap on my shoulder ruined a good long exposure.   Very nice image.  I like the slightly unfocussed and grainy quality - a real black & white feel to this.  It feels as though the image is spiralling.  9.', '2005-05-23 09:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
