(1405891, 180527, 9939, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition, lovely on all counts. I might have gone with a slightly deeper depth of field to get more of the buds in focus, but I think that''s strictly  a matter of personal taste.  10.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition, lovely on all counts. I might have gone with a slightly deeper depth of field to get more of the buds in focus, but I think that''s strictly  a matter of personal taste.  10.', '2005-05-23 11:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
