(1405927, 180755, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a cool room.   It looks vintage, and the light with the cepia tones is really nice.</td>', 'What a cool room.   It looks vintage, and the light with the cepia tones is really nice.', '2005-05-23 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
