(1406508, 180280, 22046, '<td valign="top">I almost never like photos of light on cds but this is an exception. The drops with amazing patterns are great and take this out of the ordinary into the extraordinary. And light is most certainly one of the subjects along with color and pattern. I wish it had deeper depth of field so all the drops were sharp. But it is very cool as it is. An 8 from me.</td>', 'I almost never like photos of light on cds but this is an exception. The drops with amazing patterns are great and take this out of the ordinary into the extraordinary. And light is most certainly one of the subjects along with color and pattern. I wish it had deeper depth of field so all the drops were sharp. But it is very cool as it is. An 8 from me.', '2005-05-23 16:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406511, 180812, 22046, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The way the colors and reflections of light are here it makes it look as if the watch were flying through time. Pretty cool.</td>', 'Interesting photo. The way the colors and reflections of light are here it makes it look as if the watch were flying through time. Pretty cool.', '2005-05-23 16:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406513, 180510, 22046, '<td valign="top">Right on topic. Love the glow on her face.</td>', 'Right on topic. Love the glow on her face.', '2005-05-23 16:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406517, 180812, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2005-05-23 16:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406520, 179035, 37529, '<td valign="top">Looks good.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Looks good.  Nice photo.', '2005-05-23 16:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406523, 180889, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow. Love how this is so incredibly bright and sharp. It is just inside the line of being on topic in my opinion. I''m glad because I want to give it a good score because of the wonderful composition and technical quality.</td>', 'Wow. Love how this is so incredibly bright and sharp. It is just inside the line of being on topic in my opinion. I''m glad because I want to give it a good score because of the wonderful composition and technical quality.', '2005-05-23 16:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406525, 178936, 22046, '<td valign="top">Splitting light. Works well and the colors are beautiful.</td>', 'Splitting light. Works well and the colors are beautiful.', '2005-05-23 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406531, 180356, 37529, '<td valign="top">Good macro.</td>', 'Good macro.', '2005-05-23 16:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406535, 180764, 6999, '<td valign="top">I suspect this is a fine portrait, but I think your processing for this medium has let the shot down; there is obviously definition present in all areas of the shot, but I rather think the blacks of the dog''s fur have been taken too far towards the black fo the background to make good viewing; certainly around the eyes it''s very difficult to make out any kind of expression, as everything tends towards the same black. It''s a difficult balance to make, especially for web display, where you also have to contend with the variety of other people''s monitors. That said, I  think you definitely needed to bring the dark fur areas forward from the background more.</td>', 'I suspect this is a fine portrait, but I think your processing for this medium has let the shot down; there is obviously definition present in all areas of the shot, but I rather think the blacks of the dog''s fur have been taken too far towards the black fo the background to make good viewing; certainly around the eyes it''s very difficult to make out any kind of expression, as everything tends towards the same black. It''s a difficult balance to make, especially for web display, where you also have to contend with the variety of other people''s monitors. That said, I  think you definitely needed to bring the dark fur areas forward from the background more.', '2005-05-23 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406536, 180937, 22046, '<td valign="top">Well yes, this is certainly right on target. Personally I''d like to see it just a tad less high key. I think that would make the reflected light richer without diminishing the colors in the glass. But that is a nit. This is a great idea and looks great as it is.</td>', 'Well yes, this is certainly right on target. Personally I''d like to see it just a tad less high key. I think that would make the reflected light richer without diminishing the colors in the glass. But that is a nit. This is a great idea and looks great as it is.', '2005-05-23 16:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406538, 179775, 37529, '<td valign="top">Fern seems to look alien like as they unfold.  Very good picuture and lighting I think.</td>', 'Fern seems to look alien like as they unfold.  Very good picuture and lighting I think.', '2005-05-23 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406539, 180657, 22046, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Light is surely the subject here.</td>', 'Cool idea. Light is surely the subject here.', '2005-05-23 16:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406543, 180181, 22046, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2005-05-23 16:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406544, 180205, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nothing as smooth as a babies skin.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Nothing as smooth as a babies skin.  Nice shot.', '2005-05-23 16:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406546, 180534, 22046, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh. I''d love to be here doing this. Nice use of candle light to light the model''s face.</td>', 'Ahhhh. I''d love to be here doing this. Nice use of candle light to light the model''s face.', '2005-05-23 16:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406550, 178971, 37719, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!</td>', 'Excellent photo!', '2005-05-23 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406551, 179667, 22046, '<td valign="top">Well then I guess the subject really is lighting. ;-) Looks like some kind of a jelly fish. I like it.</td>', 'Well then I guess the subject really is lighting. ;-) Looks like some kind of a jelly fish. I like it.', '2005-05-23 16:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406556, 181028, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work; I  like that I can see the window in full in the reflections. Everything in the shot is sacrificed to those eyes, which is both a good and a bad thing: they''re worth it, first, but also I feel your shot lacks some depth because of that single point of real interest.</td>', 'Nice work; I  like that I can see the window in full in the reflections. Everything in the shot is sacrificed to those eyes, which is both a good and a bad thing: they''re worth it, first, but also I feel your shot lacks some depth because of that single point of real interest.', '2005-05-23 16:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406557, 181011, 22046, '<td valign="top">What really works for me about this is the almost colorless room with the colorful chair and outdoor scene. To me it just barely fits the theme but it does, mostly because of the reflections from the window light on the roof. I really love the composition here.</td>', 'What really works for me about this is the almost colorless room with the colorful chair and outdoor scene. To me it just barely fits the theme but it does, mostly because of the reflections from the window light on the roof. I really love the composition here.', '2005-05-23 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406562, 180503, 37529, '<td valign="top">Unusual perpective.</td>', 'Unusual perpective.', '2005-05-23 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406563, 180194, 22046, '<td valign="top">There is something about this that keeps me coming back to take a look. The composition is part of it. How her eye glosw is part. The odd subdued light is part. The feeling of mystery helps too.</td>', 'There is something about this that keeps me coming back to take a look. The composition is part of it. How her eye glosw is part. The odd subdued light is part. The feeling of mystery helps too.', '2005-05-23 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406566, 180510, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice evocation of mood - though I would have trie to bring out more depth of shading in the child''s face, which has regressed a touch into a near-monochrome plane here.</td>', 'Nice evocation of mood - though I would have trie to bring out more depth of shading in the child''s face, which has regressed a touch into a near-monochrome plane here.', '2005-05-23 16:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406571, 179779, 37529, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice place to have a meal.  Greqt light pattern.</td>', 'Looks like a nice place to have a meal.  Greqt light pattern.', '2005-05-23 16:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406572, 180921, 22046, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of daylight and indoor lighting. The shadow of the cross makes it fit the topic by calling attention to the lighting. Beautiful.</td>', 'Nice combination of daylight and indoor lighting. The shadow of the cross makes it fit the topic by calling attention to the lighting. Beautiful.', '2005-05-23 16:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406577, 180194, 6999, '<td valign="top">The title feels familiar - is this a reference to another shot here? I quite like the compromise you''ve made between the texture of the veil-thing and the face: your depth of field is effective.</td>', 'The title feels familiar - is this a reference to another shot here? I quite like the compromise you''ve made between the texture of the veil-thing and the face: your depth of field is effective.', '2005-05-23 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406580, 181025, 37529, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I might have cropped some.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I might have cropped some.', '2005-05-23 16:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406581, 180720, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the cubist feel of this shot.  However I feel that it lacks shatpness or a definete focus point.</td>', 'I like the cubist feel of this shot.  However I feel that it lacks shatpness or a definete focus point.', '2005-05-23 16:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406582, 179591, 37529, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rose macro.</td>', 'Beautiful rose macro.', '2005-05-23 16:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406585, 180615, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good exposure for the window; it''s a shame, given the lack of restrictions on editing, that you couldn''t have brought more of the interior of the church into light, so to speak. The high-light out.lines on the pews are effective, but it cries out for some more detail to make it more than just an image of painted glass, to my eye.</td>', 'Good exposure for the window; it''s a shame, given the lack of restrictions on editing, that you couldn''t have brought more of the interior of the church into light, so to speak. The high-light out.lines on the pews are effective, but it cries out for some more detail to make it more than just an image of painted glass, to my eye.', '2005-05-23 16:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406587, 179460, 37529, '<td valign="top">This photo really stands out.  One of the best I think in this challenge.  Good job</td>', 'This photo really stands out.  One of the best I think in this challenge.  Good job', '2005-05-23 16:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406591, 180823, 24642, '<td valign="top">Naughty and nice.<br/>Very good lighting, beautiful models and a nice bokeh.<br/>Grrrrrrr</td>', 'Naughty and nice.Very good lighting, beautiful models and a nice bokeh.Grrrrrrr', '2005-05-23 16:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406604, 180530, 37529, '<td valign="top">Beautiful beach.  Looks like Bali Hai in the back ground?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful beach.  Looks like Bali Hai in the back ground?  Nice shot.', '2005-05-23 16:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406610, 181030, 37529, '<td valign="top">Electrifing fingers.  This is one of those how did you do it pictures?  Very good.</td>', 'Electrifing fingers.  This is one of those how did you do it pictures?  Very good.', '2005-05-23 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406718, 181034, 36689, '<td valign="top">The Star effect aroung the flame is spectacular....how did u get it ????</td>', 'The Star effect aroung the flame is spectacular....how did u get it ????', '2005-05-23 17:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406723, 180798, 34247, '<td valign="top">High impact for me. Very evocative shot.</td>', 'High impact for me. Very evocative shot.', '2005-05-23 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406737, 179559, 3214, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a ton of foreground light while still keeping detail, how her skin glows/separation of the fingers and curve delineation.</td>', 'Wow, what a ton of foreground light while still keeping detail, how her skin glows/separation of the fingers and curve delineation.', '2005-05-23 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406743, 180215, 36689, '<td valign="top">What in the world is this .... i really dont know but would sure like to know pleeeeease post a how u did it....and yes this a 10</td>', 'What in the world is this .... i really dont know but would sure like to know pleeeeease post a how u did it....and yes this a 10', '2005-05-23 18:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406764, 180811, 34134, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Love the way the light blends. The lit lamps really add to the dreamy effect. Good composition.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Love the way the light blends. The lit lamps really add to the dreamy effect. Good composition.', '2005-05-23 18:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406767, 179591, 3214, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous, light of course first, composition and tones</td>', 'Simply gorgeous, light of course first, composition and tones', '2005-05-23 18:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406772, 180996, 35122, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot....well done</td>', 'very interesting shot....well done', '2005-05-23 18:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406775, 179775, 3214, '<td valign="top">Terrific, is this fiddleneck?  Super detail, love the lighting''s direction</td>', 'Terrific, is this fiddleneck?  Super detail, love the lighting''s direction', '2005-05-23 18:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406779, 180194, 3214, '<td valign="top">Some shots just make ya say "...whoa..."  Beautiful directional light and textures</td>', 'Some shots just make ya say "...whoa..."  Beautiful directional light and textures', '2005-05-23 18:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406781, 180530, 35122, '<td valign="top">I want to be there...it''s funny...the beach is beautiful as is the water...but I''m drawn to the misty mountain....like there is just some ancient story waiting to be told...love it!!!!</td>', 'I want to be there...it''s funny...the beach is beautiful as is the water...but I''m drawn to the misty mountain....like there is just some ancient story waiting to be told...love it!!!!', '2005-05-23 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406784, 180997, 35122, '<td valign="top">love this pic...beautiful...</td>', 'love this pic...beautiful...', '2005-05-23 18:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406786, 180707, 3214, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s my monitor, but the lighting looks PERFECT to me!</td>', 'Maybe it''s my monitor, but the lighting looks PERFECT to me!', '2005-05-23 18:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1406788, 180318, 6349, '<td valign="top">thanks for being a member here.  always a pleasure to see your work.  Great shapes in this.  the contrasting triange of the hair over the eye (which reminds me of a clockwork orange posters) and the circle of the necklace...great stuff.</td>', 'thanks for being a member here.  always a pleasure to see your work.  Great shapes in this.  the contrasting triange of the hair over the eye (which reminds me of a clockwork orange posters) and the circle of the necklace...great stuff.', '2005-05-23 18:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
