(1407780, 179099, 6702, '<td valign="top">This would make a great print. Everyone who plays a [whatever this is - sax?] would love to have this hanging on their wall.</td>', 'This would make a great print. Everyone who plays a [whatever this is - sax?] would love to have this hanging on their wall.', '2005-05-24 02:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407783, 180937, 6702, '<td valign="top">I like it upside down too. The shadows and sparkles really make this shot.</td>', 'I like it upside down too. The shadows and sparkles really make this shot.', '2005-05-24 02:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407786, 179910, 6702, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good lighting, crop, border, frame. The white light in the background seems oddly shaped. It was actually the first thing that I noticed, and my eyes keep getting pulled away from the yellow to the white. Maybe a gradual gradient from dark to light would work too.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good lighting, crop, border, frame. The white light in the background seems oddly shaped. It was actually the first thing that I noticed, and my eyes keep getting pulled away from the yellow to the white. Maybe a gradual gradient from dark to light would work too.', '2005-05-24 02:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407788, 181030, 6702, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Wish I could see a few more details on the back of the hand near the wrist. Great position on the hand. Great angle, crop, border. You should do quite well with this one.</td>', 'Nice shot. Wish I could see a few more details on the back of the hand near the wrist. Great position on the hand. Great angle, crop, border. You should do quite well with this one.', '2005-05-24 02:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407794, 180714, 6702, '<td valign="top">This was a little spooky. I took a shot very similar to this back in 2003. You can see it in my portfolio. Your''s was taken earlier in the evening which I like a lot. The blue sky looks very good. And I really like the way the water turns silky with the long exposure. Good luck.</td>', 'This was a little spooky. I took a shot very similar to this back in 2003. You can see it in my portfolio. Your''s was taken earlier in the evening which I like a lot. The blue sky looks very good. And I really like the way the water turns silky with the long exposure. Good luck.', '2005-05-24 02:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407797, 180076, 6702, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. Superb sharpness, lighting.</td>', 'Great abstract. Superb sharpness, lighting.', '2005-05-24 02:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
