(1408093, 180503, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really find this image completely interesting...so amazing "simple", but so dramatic/high impact mixed with a bit of whimsy. The grain and grit is also very effective...for me this image has a really 1940''s feel to it, probably suggested by the car...very film noir. My only little nitpick, and I do mean little... is that little black booger down at the lower left hand side, it could be easily cloned out if you have PS....again really cool image.</td>', 'I really find this image completely interesting...so amazing "simple", but so dramatic/high impact mixed with a bit of whimsy. The grain and grit is also very effective...for me this image has a really 1940''s feel to it, probably suggested by the car...very film noir. My only little nitpick, and I do mean little... is that little black booger down at the lower left hand side, it could be easily cloned out if you have PS....again really cool image.', '2005-05-24 09:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408106, 179667, 35804, '<td valign="top">So that''s what they look like during the pop...great idea! Those reflections at the end of the bulb are amazing...for me, the crop is somewhat disconcerting, I''m not sure why...I think it''s the long and squat proportion that''s a bit strange for me..anyway, still an awesome image!</td>', 'So that''s what they look like during the pop...great idea! Those reflections at the end of the bulb are amazing...for me, the crop is somewhat disconcerting, I''m not sure why...I think it''s the long and squat proportion that''s a bit strange for me..anyway, still an awesome image!', '2005-05-24 10:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408119, 180842, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is truly gorgeous! I''m am actually almost speechless...the tones, the palette, the light...exquisite...10<br/> <br/>Part 2: This is still absolutely magnificent... for me,  it reminds me of a tarnished "Old Masters" painting/masterpiece...it has a completely interesting sooty...almost metallic quality about it...I actually want to buy a print of this... it has totally moved me...again, a very fine job.</td>', 'This is truly gorgeous! I''m am actually almost speechless...the tones, the palette, the light...exquisite...10 Part 2: This is still absolutely magnificent... for me,  it reminds me of a tarnished "Old Masters" painting/masterpiece...it has a completely interesting sooty...almost metallic quality about it...I actually want to buy a print of this... it has totally moved me...again, a very fine job.', '2005-05-24 10:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
