(1408642, 179765, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic quality of this image. I really like the two shafts of colored light on either side of the glass. The neutral gray tone of the glass does not work well for me. It seems a bit dull to me. I think a bit of dodging of the glass  to lighten its color would have made this interesting image even better.</td>', 'I like the graphic quality of this image. I really like the two shafts of colored light on either side of the glass. The neutral gray tone of the glass does not work well for me. It seems a bit dull to me. I think a bit of dodging of the glass  to lighten its color would have made this interesting image even better.', '2005-05-24 15:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
