(1408675, 179749, 27789, '<td valign="top">my first reaction was to just click through this photo giving it a 4 or 5, because of its processed feel, but on second glance i love the mood that it creates, more of a 2-dimensional canvas of shapes, textures, and colors.  the title perfectly fits the mood this photo creates.  10</td>', 'my first reaction was to just click through this photo giving it a 4 or 5, because of its processed feel, but on second glance i love the mood that it creates, more of a 2-dimensional canvas of shapes, textures, and colors.  the title perfectly fits the mood this photo creates.  10', '2005-05-24 15:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
