(1409154, 180927, 509, '<td valign="top">Could be improved compositionally imho.  The reflection symmetry isn''t strong enough to fix the split straight down the center.  I think this image would be strengthened (especially for this challenge) if the reflection of the sun was present in the building, possibly with a little flare to make it more dynamic.</td>', 'Could be improved compositionally imho.  The reflection symmetry isn''t strong enough to fix the split straight down the center.  I think this image would be strengthened (especially for this challenge) if the reflection of the sun was present in the building, possibly with a little flare to make it more dynamic.', '2005-05-24 19:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409161, 180206, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the technique but am unsure of the composition.  All of the clothespins are presented in the same angle with little to distinguish any one in particular from the others.  I notice the slanted position of the one, but feel that a different angle (of the camera on the pins) or arrangment of the pins might make this more compelling.  The raindrops are cool, and that should be the focus of this shot.  Instead, my eyes are drawn to the pins, but don''t find a lot of interest there.  Aside from those issues, I like the frozen aspect of the water and your exposure is well done.</td>', 'I like the technique but am unsure of the composition.  All of the clothespins are presented in the same angle with little to distinguish any one in particular from the others.  I notice the slanted position of the one, but feel that a different angle (of the camera on the pins) or arrangment of the pins might make this more compelling.  The raindrops are cool, and that should be the focus of this shot.  Instead, my eyes are drawn to the pins, but don''t find a lot of interest there.  Aside from those issues, I like the frozen aspect of the water and your exposure is well done.', '2005-05-24 19:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409163, 179746, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like how you have used the available space and light. I get the sense that the tripod is actually walking!! (Could be the strong painkillers in my system)</td>', 'I like how you have used the available space and light. I get the sense that the tripod is actually walking!! (Could be the strong painkillers in my system)', '2005-05-24 19:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409164, 180530, 6999, '<td valign="top">The near-square composition works for this shot, I think. It''s not a particularly dpc-type landscape, being only un-obviously processed, but it''s nevertheless effective. It perhaps suffers a little from division of subject: is the tonality of the beach and the shallow water, or the mountain and the cloud, the primary point of your shot? That''s not necessarily a bad thing, though it does make the shot a lot more complicated to view (again, not a bad thing), but in dpc terms I think you''ll suffer for it - had you concentrated more solidly on one or the other, you''d score higher, I think. I''m not sure that I wouldn''t personally prefer a more organised hierarchy of interest, either.</td>', 'The near-square composition works for this shot, I think. It''s not a particularly dpc-type landscape, being only un-obviously processed, but it''s nevertheless effective. It perhaps suffers a little from division of subject: is the tonality of the beach and the shallow water, or the mountain and the cloud, the primary point of your shot? That''s not necessarily a bad thing, though it does make the shot a lot more complicated to view (again, not a bad thing), but in dpc terms I think you''ll suffer for it - had you concentrated more solidly on one or the other, you''d score higher, I think. I''m not sure that I wouldn''t personally prefer a more organised hierarchy of interest, either.', '2005-05-24 19:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409165, 180356, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the colors.  Might be better as more of an abstract by cutting off the red area on the left or by leaving the red area in and shifting your camera to the left to have more of a diagonal split between the light and the background.</td>', 'I like the idea and the colors.  Might be better as more of an abstract by cutting off the red area on the left or by leaving the red area in and shifting your camera to the left to have more of a diagonal split between the light and the background.', '2005-05-24 19:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409172, 179919, 21714, '<td valign="top">The colours are nice and there''s something beautiful about the image, but it makes me ask what she''s doing or trying to do. I am also finding it hard to make a connection to her and the surroundings.</td>', 'The colours are nice and there''s something beautiful about the image, but it makes me ask what she''s doing or trying to do. I am also finding it hard to make a connection to her and the surroundings.', '2005-05-24 19:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409175, 180298, 36583, '<td valign="top">Well done. Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Well done. Beautiful capture.', '2005-05-24 19:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409178, 179482, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting stuff. I wonder if you couldn''t successfully have pushed the composition into a more blatantly graphic shot? Placing the horizon a touch higher up frame, and including a touch more of the foreground shore, and the conjunction of fore- and back-ground would have added a strong pair of lines to the shot, making the silhouette stronger, and not really losing much of the impact of the blueness, I wouldn''t imagine.  find here, the foreground hat you <i>have</i> included pretty weak, not serving much effective purpose. It has strong potential, I think, however.</td>', 'Interesting stuff. I wonder if you couldn''t successfully have pushed the composition into a more blatantly graphic shot? Placing the horizon a touch higher up frame, and including a touch more of the foreground shore, and the conjunction of fore- and back-ground would have added a strong pair of lines to the shot, making the silhouette stronger, and not really losing much of the impact of the blueness, I wouldn''t imagine.  find here, the foreground hat you have included pretty weak, not serving much effective purpose. It has strong potential, I think, however.', '2005-05-24 19:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409180, 180100, 509, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t say that lighting is a strong element of the photo here.  It seems a bit underexposed to my eye.  Also, the textrue of the ...plant?  on top is in stronger focus than the bottle, leading my eyes to wander there.  I think a closer crop on the bottle with a stronger focus and a more interesting angle (maybe shooting from the cap down with the cap in strong focus if you know what I mean) might make this more compelling.</td>', 'I wouldn''t say that lighting is a strong element of the photo here.  It seems a bit underexposed to my eye.  Also, the textrue of the ...plant?  on top is in stronger focus than the bottle, leading my eyes to wander there.  I think a closer crop on the bottle with a stronger focus and a more interesting angle (maybe shooting from the cap down with the cap in strong focus if you know what I mean) might make this more compelling.', '2005-05-24 19:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409182, 180737, 36583, '<td valign="top">Nice shot given the challenge. The top is a little too dark for me, but the bottom is great!</td>', 'Nice shot given the challenge. The top is a little too dark for me, but the bottom is great!', '2005-05-24 19:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409185, 180920, 509, '<td valign="top">Some distracting elements in the background and an errant shadow on the bottom detract from this.  For this type of shot (and I do think it is a good idea), a closer macro focus on the plant and slightly stronger backlighting might make it more interesting.  Also, compositionally the split down the center is a little unappealing.  Keep trying though.</td>', 'Some distracting elements in the background and an errant shadow on the bottom detract from this.  For this type of shot (and I do think it is a good idea), a closer macro focus on the plant and slightly stronger backlighting might make it more interesting.  Also, compositionally the split down the center is a little unappealing.  Keep trying though.', '2005-05-24 19:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409186, 180623, 36583, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Dangerous, but nice!</td>', 'Neat shot. Dangerous, but nice!', '2005-05-24 19:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409189, 180283, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I have an intense feeling of having seen this before. There''s really not much to criticise at all, I''m sure you''ve absolutely achieved your imagined shot - other than that I think you might have made more play of the shadow areas - it pays, i think, not to forget the range of points at which your audience set ''black'' on their screens.</td>', 'Beautifully done. I have an intense feeling of having seen this before. There''s really not much to criticise at all, I''m sure you''ve absolutely achieved your imagined shot - other than that I think you might have made more play of the shadow areas - it pays, i think, not to forget the range of points at which your audience set ''black'' on their screens.', '2005-05-24 19:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409190, 180451, 509, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice capture of the light, but some contrast boosts could really make this pop imho.</td>', 'Great idea and nice capture of the light, but some contrast boosts could really make this pop imho.', '2005-05-24 19:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409193, 180289, 6999, '<td valign="top">Cracked oil''s a godsend for this challenge, no?</td>', 'Cracked oil''s a godsend for this challenge, no?', '2005-05-24 19:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409194, 180586, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and exposure.  The nose is a little out of focus, but otherwise a great capture.</td>', 'Nice subject and exposure.  The nose is a little out of focus, but otherwise a great capture.', '2005-05-24 19:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409195, 180811, 36583, '<td valign="top">Wow... Beautiful colors. I wish background wasn''t tract homes, but still very nice!</td>', 'Wow... Beautiful colors. I wish background wasn''t tract homes, but still very nice!', '2005-05-24 19:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409199, 180478, 509, '<td valign="top">A really cool capture, especially with the green light cast on the old machinery.  You''ve presented a great contrast between light and dark and the composition is very strong.  Nice work.</td>', 'A really cool capture, especially with the green light cast on the old machinery.  You''ve presented a great contrast between light and dark and the composition is very strong.  Nice work.', '2005-05-24 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409202, 180602, 36583, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool shot. Remnants of a wildfire? I like the ashen look... Well done.</td>', 'That''s a cool shot. Remnants of a wildfire? I like the ashen look... Well done.', '2005-05-24 19:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409207, 179551, 36583, '<td valign="top">Nice textures... Nice colors... Interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice textures... Nice colors... Interesting shot.', '2005-05-24 19:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409213, 180749, 36583, '<td valign="top">What sky! Nice shot.</td>', 'What sky! Nice shot.', '2005-05-24 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409217, 180034, 21714, '<td valign="top">I wonder if it''s a certain software that does it or it''s down to personal preference, but I have come across a few images like this recently on DPC. Something about it that looks to me like there''s a clear layer of paint over it hiding some fine details otherwise present in the image. I can never be cerain, but there''s definitely something odd about it - some sort of filter at an earlier stage perhaps. Or maybe I am just not familiar with something ..<br/> <br/>And yeah - I like the shot :)</td>', 'I wonder if it''s a certain software that does it or it''s down to personal preference, but I have come across a few images like this recently on DPC. Something about it that looks to me like there''s a clear layer of paint over it hiding some fine details otherwise present in the image. I can never be cerain, but there''s definitely something odd about it - some sort of filter at an earlier stage perhaps. Or maybe I am just not familiar with something .. And yeah - I like the shot :)', '2005-05-24 19:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409218, 180808, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  Is this a lighthouse?  Very nice work - 10</td>', 'This is a great shot!  Is this a lighthouse?  Very nice work - 10', '2005-05-24 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409223, 180842, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. What a wonderful image this is!</td>', 'Beautiful. What a wonderful image this is!', '2005-05-24 19:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409236, 180996, 21714, '<td valign="top">It sometimes amazes me how well these images work. When I think about it, it''s the idea and your vision that''s made it interesting. It''s definitely not going to be loved by the majority on DPC, but, I for one am thankful that you did it. <br/></td>', 'It sometimes amazes me how well these images work. When I think about it, it''s the idea and your vision that''s made it interesting. It''s definitely not going to be loved by the majority on DPC, but, I for one am thankful that you did it. ', '2005-05-24 19:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409242, 180749, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful piece of time captured here. I want to be there and enjoy it.</td>', 'Wonderful piece of time captured here. I want to be there and enjoy it.', '2005-05-24 20:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409252, 180931, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I love what you have done here. Amazing how you have created the tension in this one. Bravo.</td>', 'Very creative. I love what you have done here. Amazing how you have created the tension in this one. Bravo.', '2005-05-24 20:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409266, 180755, 21714, '<td valign="top">Striking balance and tones overall. One of those images where you want to get in with a torch and explore the shadows.</td>', 'Striking balance and tones overall. One of those images where you want to get in with a torch and explore the shadows.', '2005-05-24 20:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409271, 179779, 21714, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to enjoy that! Beautiful.</td>', 'I would have loved to enjoy that! Beautiful.', '2005-05-24 20:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409274, 180034, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully cpatured image, the tonalities are to die for. I wish it were not cropped so tight to the main pillar on the bottom, and I wish the arch were completed at the top. There''s also a very off sense that this is laning over tot he right. I say "odd" because checking with an alignment aid shows that most of the verticals are indeed vertical. Oddly enough, the one in the BG next to the guard is not... Whatever... Nice shot!</td>', 'This is a beautifully cpatured image, the tonalities are to die for. I wish it were not cropped so tight to the main pillar on the bottom, and I wish the arch were completed at the top. There''s also a very off sense that this is laning over tot he right. I say "odd" because checking with an alignment aid shows that most of the verticals are indeed vertical. Oddly enough, the one in the BG next to the guard is not... Whatever... Nice shot!', '2005-05-24 20:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409283, 180897, 30861, '<td valign="top">I got to love this one. What a unique take ont he challenge! It''s not quite sharom which hurts it a fair amount. Still, I admire the breadth of this and I admire you for entering it. I hope it does better than i suspect it is doing. 8 from me.</td>', 'I got to love this one. What a unique take ont he challenge! It''s not quite sharom which hurts it a fair amount. Still, I admire the breadth of this and I admire you for entering it. I hope it does better than i suspect it is doing. 8 from me.', '2005-05-24 20:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409287, 180286, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good composition and viewpoint.  You have done a good job in very tough lighting conditions.</td>', 'Good composition and viewpoint.  You have done a good job in very tough lighting conditions.', '2005-05-24 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409312, 180822, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good colours and bold composition.</td>', 'Good colours and bold composition.', '2005-05-24 20:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409334, 180623, 24642, '<td valign="top">Fast and flowing.  Good use of wide angle lens.</td>', 'Fast and flowing.  Good use of wide angle lens.', '2005-05-24 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409343, 180819, 34217, '<td valign="top">your lighting is really flat and boring and one of your strawberries has a gross spot on it.  You did a good job of arranging them, but if you want to photograph food, your food needs to be flawless and your lighting needs to be beautiful and give depth.  Try not to light so straight on.</td>', 'your lighting is really flat and boring and one of your strawberries has a gross spot on it.  You did a good job of arranging them, but if you want to photograph food, your food needs to be flawless and your lighting needs to be beautiful and give depth.  Try not to light so straight on.', '2005-05-24 20:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409347, 180318, 19831, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept here. I''m afraid a lot of the voters here may look at it as "over processed", but I kind of like the effect. I like the composition, and a definite ''mood'' is present. I''m thinking though, that I wish you could see the eye that is not covered by hair. I think that that might make a stronger emotional connection.</td>', 'An interesting concept here. I''m afraid a lot of the voters here may look at it as "over processed", but I kind of like the effect. I like the composition, and a definite ''mood'' is present. I''m thinking though, that I wish you could see the eye that is not covered by hair. I think that that might make a stronger emotional connection.', '2005-05-24 20:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409350, 179748, 34217, '<td valign="top">Hey I drive past here all the time!  you  must be close by :)</td>', 'Hey I drive past here all the time!  you  must be close by :)', '2005-05-24 20:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409355, 180595, 34217, '<td valign="top">Great moment, but I would not say that the lighting is what makes this picture.  Sure the flash froze the moment, but it is not a defining feature in this pic, the brides facial expression and the movement make this shot what it is.  So  A+ for catching this moment, but as far as the challenge is concerned, I don''t think it is a good fit.</td>', 'Great moment, but I would not say that the lighting is what makes this picture.  Sure the flash froze the moment, but it is not a defining feature in this pic, the brides facial expression and the movement make this shot what it is.  So  A+ for catching this moment, but as far as the challenge is concerned, I don''t think it is a good fit.', '2005-05-24 20:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409356, 180487, 34904, '<td valign="top">Clever idea!!!  Gave it an eight.  Don''t know for sure if the tungsten color was left in to make the smiley face yellow/orange.  Not marking down for the color cast.  Good frame color selection.</td>', 'Clever idea!!!  Gave it an eight.  Don''t know for sure if the tungsten color was left in to make the smiley face yellow/orange.  Not marking down for the color cast.  Good frame color selection.', '2005-05-24 20:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409362, 181032, 34217, '<td valign="top">nice light, but I would have prefered to see the front of the horse of the side, not the rear end</td>', 'nice light, but I would have prefered to see the front of the horse of the side, not the rear end', '2005-05-24 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409385, 179559, 34217, '<td valign="top">nice light, not may people know how to photograph children well.  You did a good job.</td>', 'nice light, not may people know how to photograph children well.  You did a good job.', '2005-05-24 20:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409390, 180615, 34217, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more detail in the dark area.  Otherwise you just have a floating window</td>', 'I would have liked to see more detail in the dark area.  Otherwise you just have a floating window', '2005-05-24 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409394, 180527, 34217, '<td valign="top">I would call this perfect lighting!</td>', 'I would call this perfect lighting!', '2005-05-24 20:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
