(1409400, 179337, 34904, '<td valign="top">Great idea.   I''m scoring it a 7.  The contrast seems to be a bit too sharp for my taste.  A couple of the model''s fingernails are dirty, perhaps a manicure would have helped.  Her face is slightly out of focus.  Perhaps a lighter border/frame would have helped.</td>', 'Great idea.   I''m scoring it a 7.  The contrast seems to be a bit too sharp for my taste.  A couple of the model''s fingernails are dirty, perhaps a manicure would have helped.  Her face is slightly out of focus.  Perhaps a lighter border/frame would have helped.', '2005-05-24 20:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
