(1411102, 180798, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good idea and capture, unfortunately I think those hands have become exagerrated and do not look as though they belong to a child. I do love the way it all blends into that black background - good luck</td>', 'Good idea and capture, unfortunately I think those hands have become exagerrated and do not look as though they belong to a child. I do love the way it all blends into that black background - good luck', '2005-05-25 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411117, 180757, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very delicately done, I think it would have been better still with a shallower DOF to throw the background into less distracting backdrop</td>', 'Very delicately done, I think it would have been better still with a shallower DOF to throw the background into less distracting backdrop', '2005-05-25 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411120, 179947, 25024, '<td valign="top">Effectively done, I like the focus and the black background</td>', 'Effectively done, I like the focus and the black background', '2005-05-25 10:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411130, 180769, 25024, '<td valign="top">Classic capture of light fulfils the challenge well, I''m not sure about the posts though, if its part of a pier it may have been better to include it as a strong compositional element.</td>', 'Classic capture of light fulfils the challenge well, I''m not sure about the posts though, if its part of a pier it may have been better to include it as a strong compositional element.', '2005-05-25 10:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411133, 179746, 38264, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2005-05-25 10:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411134, 180530, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and the colours have been well rendered - good luck</td>', 'Good exposure and the colours have been well rendered - good luck', '2005-05-25 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411143, 180487, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good effort, unfortunately the reflections havent quite worked as well as you might have hoped, but top marks for creativity and originality</td>', 'Nice idea and good effort, unfortunately the reflections havent quite worked as well as you might have hoped, but top marks for creativity and originality', '2005-05-25 10:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411147, 180258, 32105, '<td valign="top">Good for a zoo photo - so hard to get</td>', 'Good for a zoo photo - so hard to get', '2005-05-25 10:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411148, 180755, 25024, '<td valign="top">This is a nice atmospheric study that has been well captured, it works well in mono - good luck</td>', 'This is a nice atmospheric study that has been well captured, it works well in mono - good luck', '2005-05-25 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411152, 180623, 25024, '<td valign="top">Yes, I like this. Its been well captured in terms of light and composition - good luck</td>', 'Yes, I like this. Its been well captured in terms of light and composition - good luck', '2005-05-25 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411155, 180842, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good still life - I like the subdued colours and composition and choice of format</td>', 'Good still life - I like the subdued colours and composition and choice of format', '2005-05-25 10:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411157, 180887, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice contre jour,  just wish the composition had a stronger focal point - good luck</td>', 'Nice contre jour,  just wish the composition had a stronger focal point - good luck', '2005-05-25 10:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411169, 180093, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting which is what this challenge is all about. I''m sure you''ll get some comments about the blue balls in the background but I like the amount of OOF, where I think it could be improved would be to crop tight to the first ball thus eliminating the somewhat distracting foreground branch, just my thoughts, good luck</td>', 'Nice lighting which is what this challenge is all about. I''m sure you''ll get some comments about the blue balls in the background but I like the amount of OOF, where I think it could be improved would be to crop tight to the first ball thus eliminating the somewhat distracting foreground branch, just my thoughts, good luck', '2005-05-25 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411174, 180992, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, the light, composition, background is all just right. Was this really shot under moonlight?</td>', 'I like this a lot, the light, composition, background is all just right. Was this really shot under moonlight?', '2005-05-25 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411191, 180994, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hmm was my first reaction. The more I look at this the more I like it. I like the blackness and the roof light and the painted effect through the window but  I wondered where the red light is coming from, presumably its red carpet? I think if that had been a wooden floor it would have completed it. Good luck</td>', 'Hmm was my first reaction. The more I look at this the more I like it. I like the blackness and the roof light and the painted effect through the window but  I wondered where the red light is coming from, presumably its red carpet? I think if that had been a wooden floor it would have completed it. Good luck', '2005-05-25 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411196, 180257, 25024, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting. I like the light on and through the glass and I like the warm effect of the wood - well done</td>', 'Excellent lighting. I like the light on and through the glass and I like the warm effect of the wood - well done', '2005-05-25 11:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411204, 180579, 25024, '<td valign="top">I love the long shadows and the lighting on the girl and a good composition</td>', 'I love the long shadows and the lighting on the girl and a good composition', '2005-05-25 11:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411213, 180915, 25024, '<td valign="top">I feel so sorry for this poor chap, the lighting has brought out the texture of his skin well - an obvious criticsm that you probably couldnt avoid is the distracting frame in the background - good luck</td>', 'I feel so sorry for this poor chap, the lighting has brought out the texture of his skin well - an obvious criticsm that you probably couldnt avoid is the distracting frame in the background - good luck', '2005-05-25 11:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411221, 180975, 25024, '<td valign="top">Tricky shot, good attempt but flare in the lower half is not really helping this - good luck</td>', 'Tricky shot, good attempt but flare in the lower half is not really helping this - good luck', '2005-05-25 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411228, 180283, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting. The light and dark and general theme and your exposure have made this very effective</td>', 'Good composition and lighting. The light and dark and general theme and your exposure have made this very effective', '2005-05-25 11:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411233, 180714, 25024, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture fits the challenge well - good luck</td>', 'Excellent capture fits the challenge well - good luck', '2005-05-25 11:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411250, 180526, 25024, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. A very dramatic effect, I love the almost minimalism of it - good luck</td>', 'This is a great capture. A very dramatic effect, I love the almost minimalism of it - good luck', '2005-05-25 11:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411253, 180811, 25024, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and mood to this just a shame about the right foreground which for me detracts from the overall effect - good luck</td>', 'Lovely colours and mood to this just a shame about the right foreground which for me detracts from the overall effect - good luck', '2005-05-25 11:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411263, 179779, 25024, '<td valign="top">Yes, very effective lighting and shadows fits the theme well - good luck</td>', 'Yes, very effective lighting and shadows fits the theme well - good luck', '2005-05-25 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411276, 180317, 37200, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity yet enough repetition and the glass piece keep it interesting.</td>', 'I like the simplicity yet enough repetition and the glass piece keep it interesting.', '2005-05-25 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411290, 180798, 9939, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the understated tones and the "Poltergeist-y" look on her face. The hands look enormous, but that''s likely an effect created by the silhouetting and by the distance to the camera. Nice work.</td>', 'Cool. I like the understated tones and the "Poltergeist-y" look on her face. The hands look enormous, but that''s likely an effect created by the silhouetting and by the distance to the camera. Nice work.', '2005-05-25 11:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411292, 180526, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice concept.  The line along your thumb is a bit harsh.  Good job with the long exposure, only the cigarette shows any motion blur, subject''s face is nice and crisp.</td>', 'nice concept.  The line along your thumb is a bit harsh.  Good job with the long exposure, only the cigarette shows any motion blur, subject''s face is nice and crisp.', '2005-05-25 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411299, 180286, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I love the mood created by all the redness. I wish we could see more detail, particularly in his face, but I know that''s difficult to accomplish when shooting directly into the light.</td>', 'Great composition and I love the mood created by all the redness. I wish we could see more detail, particularly in his face, but I know that''s difficult to accomplish when shooting directly into the light.', '2005-05-25 11:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411308, 180094, 9939, '<td valign="top">The colors and pose make it look like something out of a cyberpunk movie.  I''d be interested to see the results with the light source positioned in different places, the effects might be even more dramatic. Ineresting shot for sure.</td>', 'The colors and pose make it look like something out of a cyberpunk movie.  I''d be interested to see the results with the light source positioned in different places, the effects might be even more dramatic. Ineresting shot for sure.', '2005-05-25 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411319, 180449, 9939, '<td valign="top">Looks perhaps like a shot taken during a play or performance of some sort. I think the harsh lighting works given the subject matter and mood. The red and black dress makes this eye popping.</td>', 'Looks perhaps like a shot taken during a play or performance of some sort. I think the harsh lighting works given the subject matter and mood. The red and black dress makes this eye popping.', '2005-05-25 11:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411332, 181012, 9939, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I wouldn''t consider an azalea bush to be all that comfortable :)<br/> <br/>Lovely lighting and nice colors. Her hair over her throat and in shadow kind of creates the illusion of a disembodied head, and her positioning does make this feel very unnatural to me- as if she''s sitting next to the bush and leaning way back into it. The arm position also feels awkward to me. I might have tried several different positions to see if one yielded a more pleasing and enjoyable looking result.</td>', 'Hmmm, I wouldn''t consider an azalea bush to be all that comfortable :) Lovely lighting and nice colors. Her hair over her throat and in shadow kind of creates the illusion of a disembodied head, and her positioning does make this feel very unnatural to me- as if she''s sitting next to the bush and leaning way back into it. The arm position also feels awkward to me. I might have tried several different positions to see if one yielded a more pleasing and enjoyable looking result.', '2005-05-25 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411341, 181025, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. It might be a bit more mystical and impactful to have the model wearing something more appropriate than jeans and a tshirt- perhaps robes or something.</td>', 'Very nice effect. It might be a bit more mystical and impactful to have the model wearing something more appropriate than jeans and a tshirt- perhaps robes or something.', '2005-05-25 11:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411371, 180415, 37200, '<td valign="top">amazing capture!  was this right place/right time or some post processing effects?</td>', 'amazing capture!  was this right place/right time or some post processing effects?', '2005-05-25 11:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411374, 180944, 37200, '<td valign="top">great textures.</td>', 'great textures.', '2005-05-25 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411389, 180961, 37200, '<td valign="top">the rotation on this makes it much more dynamic.</td>', 'the rotation on this makes it much more dynamic.', '2005-05-25 12:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411394, 180842, 37200, '<td valign="top">interesting treatment, gives a unique quality to this entry</td>', 'interesting treatment, gives a unique quality to this entry', '2005-05-25 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411401, 181005, 37200, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and purple background.  Nothing to do with the photo, but the bird''s eye is kind of freaky.</td>', 'I like the lighting and purple background.  Nothing to do with the photo, but the bird''s eye is kind of freaky.', '2005-05-25 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411405, 179460, 37200, '<td valign="top">I love the textures in this.  Just the right amount of soft shadows really make this a great shot!</td>', 'I love the textures in this.  Just the right amount of soft shadows really make this a great shot!', '2005-05-25 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411430, 180842, 11895, '<td valign="top">a very nice image that is a little too dark, more detail would make it even more attractive</td>', 'a very nice image that is a little too dark, more detail would make it even more attractive', '2005-05-25 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411455, 180920, 37200, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and subject.</td>', 'Interesting composition and subject.', '2005-05-25 12:37:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1411466, 179748, 37200, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2005-05-25 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411476, 180806, 37200, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the level of lighting/exposure.  Only suggestion I have would be to have clean cut holes rather than the jagged/torn ones.</td>', 'Great shot, love the level of lighting/exposure.  Only suggestion I have would be to have clean cut holes rather than the jagged/torn ones.', '2005-05-25 12:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411477, 180998, 38286, '<td valign="top">Very simple, yet very striking</td>', 'Very simple, yet very striking', '2005-05-25 12:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411504, 180203, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool image . Maybe a little heavy on the water. I might have cropped it higher. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a very cool image . Maybe a little heavy on the water. I might have cropped it higher. Nice work.', '2005-05-25 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411515, 180578, 32767, '<td valign="top">I took almost the exact same shot with the same beer in a bar. Blue Moon Hefeweizen. I''ll show you when I find out who you are. Nice image.</td>', 'I took almost the exact same shot with the same beer in a bar. Blue Moon Hefeweizen. I''ll show you when I find out who you are. Nice image.', '2005-05-25 13:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411532, 179491, 9939, '<td valign="top">Asounding color- I love the light. The composition is excellent. 10!</td>', 'Asounding color- I love the light. The composition is excellent. 10!', '2005-05-25 13:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411541, 180194, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. The texture and detail is excellent, and I love the tones! 10.</td>', 'Very lovely. The texture and detail is excellent, and I love the tones! 10.', '2005-05-25 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411545, 180909, 9939, '<td valign="top">Missed this on the first pass- its lovely!! Nicely done. 10.</td>', 'Missed this on the first pass- its lovely!! Nicely done. 10.', '2005-05-25 13:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411550, 180981, 24454, '<td valign="top">Absolutely BEAUTIFUL display of light shining on the rushing water.   These pictures of the rushing water using a slow shutter speed make my heart feel good when I look at them.   You did such an excellent job on this.   I love it!!!!    Good luck!!   This deserves an excellent score!!!   10</td>', 'Absolutely BEAUTIFUL display of light shining on the rushing water.   These pictures of the rushing water using a slow shutter speed make my heart feel good when I look at them.   You did such an excellent job on this.   I love it!!!!    Good luck!!   This deserves an excellent score!!!   10', '2005-05-25 13:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411551, 180923, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very pretty- I assume the back of her clothing is the most interesting, though it does make me curious to see the front. A looser composition would appeal to me a little more in this case.</td>', 'Very pretty- I assume the back of her clothing is the most interesting, though it does make me curious to see the front. A looser composition would appeal to me a little more in this case.', '2005-05-25 13:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411552, 179704, 9939, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot- I''ve nothing to suggest! 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot- I''ve nothing to suggest! 10.', '2005-05-25 13:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411563, 181028, 9939, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous eyes, I think her hand in the composition cramps the frame and detracts from her beauty- especially with this crop, as it makes the hand position look awkward. I love the light, just the right amount of detail.</td>', 'Gorgeous eyes, I think her hand in the composition cramps the frame and detracts from her beauty- especially with this crop, as it makes the hand position look awkward. I love the light, just the right amount of detail.', '2005-05-25 13:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411570, 180618, 9939, '<td valign="top">Looks like something out of a Hitchcock movie- well composed, nice tones. And I love the choice of an old corded phone! The light makes me think of car headlights, which might be a little odd for this situation- unless perhaps we pull back and see him looking out a window?  I would like to see just a tiny more detail in the right eye.</td>', 'Looks like something out of a Hitchcock movie- well composed, nice tones. And I love the choice of an old corded phone! The light makes me think of car headlights, which might be a little odd for this situation- unless perhaps we pull back and see him looking out a window?  I would like to see just a tiny more detail in the right eye.', '2005-05-25 13:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411572, 179987, 9939, '<td valign="top">She certainly doesn''t look happy about having a bath ;)<br/> <br/>Lovely composition and lighting, I wish there was a tiny bit more detail on the left side of her face.</td>', 'She certainly doesn''t look happy about having a bath ;) Lovely composition and lighting, I wish there was a tiny bit more detail on the left side of her face.', '2005-05-25 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411580, 180818, 9939, '<td valign="top">I certainly understand the choice to expose for her face, but this still feels way too bright. The crop also feels quite tight, it''d be nice to see what she''s doing to make it more of an environmental portrait.</td>', 'I certainly understand the choice to expose for her face, but this still feels way too bright. The crop also feels quite tight, it''d be nice to see what she''s doing to make it more of an environmental portrait.', '2005-05-25 13:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411587, 179591, 7190, '<td valign="top">Really had a hard time voting on this, the lighting is excellent but there are so many water drops it detracts from the image a. it makes a delcate flower image too phoney looking. There are two things that drive me crazy on dpc, bad high key lighting and water drops on everything.</td>', 'Really had a hard time voting on this, the lighting is excellent but there are so many water drops it detracts from the image a. it makes a delcate flower image too phoney looking. There are two things that drive me crazy on dpc, bad high key lighting and water drops on everything.', '2005-05-25 13:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411639, 180823, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice lighting overall, maybe a touch more hair light would be nice.  Skin tones seem to have a pink cast to them.</td>', 'nice lighting overall, maybe a touch more hair light would be nice.  Skin tones seem to have a pink cast to them.', '2005-05-25 13:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411647, 179976, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice idea, I like the depth this has.  But, the close leaves on the right bother me a bit...but they really add to the depth.  Can you tell I''m tossed on this one? :-)</td>', 'nice idea, I like the depth this has.  But, the close leaves on the right bother me a bit...but they really add to the depth.  Can you tell I''m tossed on this one? :-)', '2005-05-25 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
