(1413306, 180076, 14671, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I can see what appears to be curtains on the right side of the photo and found it to be very distracting as it was one of the first things that drew my eyes.  Its also off centered.unbalanced.  I do like the abstractness of the photo tho. well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Unfortunately I can see what appears to be curtains on the right side of the photo and found it to be very distracting as it was one of the first things that drew my eyes.  Its also off centered.unbalanced.  I do like the abstractness of the photo tho. well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-05-26 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1413308, 179921, 14671, '<td valign="top">When submitting to a challenge  find it best to ask myself, Is this something I''d hang on a wall???   I also think this photo would have looked better if it was converted to B&amp;W.  However it is an interesting way to shoot a hallway and looks pretty crisp.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'When submitting to a challenge  find it best to ask myself, Is this something I''d hang on a wall???   I also think this photo would have looked better if it was converted to B&W.  However it is an interesting way to shoot a hallway and looks pretty crisp.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-05-26 08:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
