(1413328, 180915, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of this shot at all.  Aside from natural ligt there is no other lighting.  However it is a nice photo, very crisp and nice choice in DoF.  I think this would have been better in a different challenge.  Good luck in tihs chalenge.</td>', 'I''m not fond of this shot at all.  Aside from natural ligt there is no other lighting.  However it is a nice photo, very crisp and nice choice in DoF.  I think this would have been better in a different challenge.  Good luck in tihs chalenge.', '2005-05-26 08:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
