(1413777, 180606, 34217, '<td valign="top">pretty girl, she has lovely skin.  I would have like to see the catch light in the eyes.  Without it the subject does not feel as alive.</td>', 'pretty girl, she has lovely skin.  I would have like to see the catch light in the eyes.  Without it the subject does not feel as alive.', '2005-05-26 13:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1413781, 180478, 34217, '<td valign="top">it looks like you created that beam of light in photoshop.  I think it would look more real if the edges were not so sharp.  If the light would have faned out a little maybe.  If the beam of light is real, then...I guess I was wrong (it happens sometimes)</td>', 'it looks like you created that beam of light in photoshop.  I think it would look more real if the edges were not so sharp.  If the light would have faned out a little maybe.  If the beam of light is real, then...I guess I was wrong (it happens sometimes)', '2005-05-26 13:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1413800, 181028, 34217, '<td valign="top">pretty light on the left side of the face.  To fill in that shadow on the other side, just hold oup something white.  Maybe a pillow case or a poster board.  You will be amazed at what it can do.  By the way, the posing of the hand makes it look a little big, it is kinda distracting.  Hands are very hard to photograph, nice try</td>', 'pretty light on the left side of the face.  To fill in that shadow on the other side, just hold oup something white.  Maybe a pillow case or a poster board.  You will be amazed at what it can do.  By the way, the posing of the hand makes it look a little big, it is kinda distracting.  Hands are very hard to photograph, nice try', '2005-05-26 13:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
