(1414688, 180931, 17837, '<td valign="top">all that negative space doesnt really help the photo. Its a valient effort, though the spot of the right eyebrow is a bit distracting, think it would have been better if it werent lit up.</td>', 'all that negative space doesnt really help the photo. Its a valient effort, though the spot of the right eyebrow is a bit distracting, think it would have been better if it werent lit up.', '2005-05-26 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
