(1414696, 179951, 17837, '<td valign="top">The photo is out of focus, and the lighting isnt really all that spectacular. I do imagine that this was a crop from a larger image, hence the out of focus feet.</td>', 'The photo is out of focus, and the lighting isnt really all that spectacular. I do imagine that this was a crop from a larger image, hence the out of focus feet.', '2005-05-26 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414700, 181005, 17837, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very harsh on the bird, and he is white so that makes it a whole different ballpark for exposure. Keep at it though!</td>', 'The lighting is very harsh on the bird, and he is white so that makes it a whole different ballpark for exposure. Keep at it though!', '2005-05-26 20:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414703, 180803, 17837, '<td valign="top">The bottle cap is blown out, but the rest of the image is pretty decent. as it is, its just a bottle of sprite. I think would you have poured some salt in there and let it overflow to capture it, you would have a much more stellar image and probably a top 50 entry. Good luck.</td>', 'The bottle cap is blown out, but the rest of the image is pretty decent. as it is, its just a bottle of sprite. I think would you have poured some salt in there and let it overflow to capture it, you would have a much more stellar image and probably a top 50 entry. Good luck.', '2005-05-26 20:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414705, 178804, 17837, '<td valign="top">The lens flare does nothing for this image, and if you arent careful you can damage your sensor if you point it straight into the sun.</td>', 'The lens flare does nothing for this image, and if you arent careful you can damage your sensor if you point it straight into the sun.', '2005-05-26 20:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414708, 179987, 17837, '<td valign="top">great use of lighting, however, one thing that bothers me. I can just make her right eye out, and I believe the rule to be you either show the eye, or hide it. Its a tad distracting for me, some burning would remedy this. GL</td>', 'great use of lighting, however, one thing that bothers me. I can just make her right eye out, and I believe the rule to be you either show the eye, or hide it. Its a tad distracting for me, some burning would remedy this. GL', '2005-05-26 20:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414713, 180398, 509, '<td valign="top">Simple concept, decent execution.  There seems to be some highlights lost in the lamp bulb, but the contrasts are nice.</td>', 'Simple concept, decent execution.  There seems to be some highlights lost in the lamp bulb, but the contrasts are nice.', '2005-05-26 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414714, 180287, 17837, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the image larger, and it needs more light, more contrast. It''s really flat looking.</td>', 'I would like to see the image larger, and it needs more light, more contrast. It''s really flat looking.', '2005-05-26 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414718, 179921, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and subject.  A black and white treatment with some dodging and burning around the lights might add impact.</td>', 'I like the framing and subject.  A black and white treatment with some dodging and burning around the lights might add impact.', '2005-05-26 20:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414719, 180194, 17837, '<td valign="top">I do believe this will finish top3. Great lighting, great use of a diffuser IN the photograph. Good pose, though her mouth would be better shut. Theres a saying, if you wanna hear it, feel free to PM me and ill tell you. It''s not very appropriate lol. 10</td>', 'I do believe this will finish top3. Great lighting, great use of a diffuser IN the photograph. Good pose, though her mouth would be better shut. Theres a saying, if you wanna hear it, feel free to PM me and ill tell you. It''s not very appropriate lol. 10', '2005-05-26 20:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414723, 180300, 17837, '<td valign="top">The subject could be stronger, I think infra reds to best on open landscapes with lots of clouds and lots of greens. Though, there are acceptions.</td>', 'The subject could be stronger, I think infra reds to best on open landscapes with lots of clouds and lots of greens. Though, there are acceptions.', '2005-05-26 20:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414727, 179801, 17837, '<td valign="top">This is hard to judge. Is this actual lighting? Or just good dodge and burn work...</td>', 'This is hard to judge. Is this actual lighting? Or just good dodge and burn work...', '2005-05-26 20:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414731, 180798, 17837, '<td valign="top">This image is great yet disturbing. Its a great photo, but not sure about the implied nudity of what seems to be a child.</td>', 'This image is great yet disturbing. Its a great photo, but not sure about the implied nudity of what seems to be a child.', '2005-05-26 20:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414746, 180596, 15919, '<td valign="top">Strange and original but not sure.</td>', 'Strange and original but not sure.', '2005-05-26 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414751, 180280, 15919, '<td valign="top">Drops and a CD, maybe not very orignal here but still very good.  Like the colorful lines.</td>', 'Drops and a CD, maybe not very orignal here but still very good.  Like the colorful lines.', '2005-05-26 20:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414762, 180749, 15919, '<td valign="top">Great image.  The sky is magnificant and the forground is full of life and action.  Good b&amp;w conversion to. The light is important here but not sure it´s playing the main role here, more than in every photograph.</td>', 'Great image.  The sky is magnificant and the forground is full of life and action.  Good b&w conversion to. The light is important here but not sure it´s playing the main role here, more than in every photograph.', '2005-05-26 20:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414765, 180503, 15919, '<td valign="top">strange, original = very good</td>', 'strange, original = very good', '2005-05-26 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414768, 179491, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful light indeed. Striking colors too. Somehow, though, there is not one strong subject for the eye to settle on. The strongest part of the rainbow is at the lower end, where it''s offset by the brightly lit house, which leads somehow to a sense of imbalance... of course, you couldn''t have possibly moved either around :). Nice job, and great light!</td>', 'Very beautiful light indeed. Striking colors too. Somehow, though, there is not one strong subject for the eye to settle on. The strongest part of the rainbow is at the lower end, where it''s offset by the brightly lit house, which leads somehow to a sense of imbalance... of course, you couldn''t have possibly moved either around :). Nice job, and great light!', '2005-05-26 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414770, 180811, 5286, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful scene, with striking color. I would have left a lot more space on the right...</td>', 'It''s a beautiful scene, with striking color. I would have left a lot more space on the right...', '2005-05-26 20:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414771, 180258, 15919, '<td valign="top">Why are you so serous, what are you thinking about?  Very nice.  But lightning?  Well got light on his face.  Not sure.  Very good image though.</td>', 'Why are you so serous, what are you thinking about?  Very nice.  But lightning?  Well got light on his face.  Not sure.  Very good image though.', '2005-05-26 20:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414773, 180093, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, wish the bird were sharper.</td>', 'Nice colors, wish the bird were sharper.', '2005-05-26 20:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414774, 180892, 5286, '<td valign="top">Lacks strong subject.</td>', 'Lacks strong subject.', '2005-05-26 20:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414776, 180756, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! You got the focus on the prism really sharp. I suspect that playing around with the white balance would have led to a cleaner white color here, which would increase the impact a lot. Also a little more space on the top left would help the balance.</td>', 'Nice idea! You got the focus on the prism really sharp. I suspect that playing around with the white balance would have led to a cleaner white color here, which would increase the impact a lot. Also a little more space on the top left would help the balance.', '2005-05-26 20:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414778, 180206, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice picture! Wonder if a more diagonal tilt to the line would help? Great use of flash to capture the raindrops.</td>', 'Nice picture! Wonder if a more diagonal tilt to the line would help? Great use of flash to capture the raindrops.', '2005-05-26 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414780, 180206, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very cool and well performed image.  But light (above every image), not sure.  As explaned bye the title (dadadadra) you are using advanced light sorce but arent we always.</td>', 'Very cool and well performed image.  But light (above every image), not sure.  As explaned bye the title (dadadadra) you are using advanced light sorce but arent we always.', '2005-05-26 21:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
