(1414794, 180587, 24642, '<td valign="top">Lighting is important in this timeless photograph.  The composition is good and the soft focus adds drama and tension.</td>', 'Lighting is important in this timeless photograph.  The composition is good and the soft focus adds drama and tension.', '2005-05-26 21:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
