(1414799, 180287, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good pose.  Lighting is good but the size and lack of sharpness really decrease the impact.  -6</td>', 'A good pose.  Lighting is good but the size and lack of sharpness really decrease the impact.  -6', '2005-05-26 21:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
