(1414812, 180534, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  Very sensual.  I find the big candles in the cornes a bit distracting</td>', 'A good idea.  Very sensual.  I find the big candles in the cornes a bit distracting', '2005-05-26 21:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
