(1414957, 180203, 37200, '<td valign="top">I don''t so much care for the starburst effects (small aperature??), but the fountain is awsome!!</td>', 'I don''t so much care for the starburst effects (small aperature??), but the fountain is awsome!!', '2005-05-26 22:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414959, 180937, 37200, '<td valign="top">very cool, I love the unique perspective and how it fits the challenge so perfectly!</td>', 'very cool, I love the unique perspective and how it fits the challenge so perfectly!', '2005-05-26 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415049, 180434, 1827, '<td valign="top">Great title for this image.  Good take on the challenge.  I like the B/W conversion.  My only CC really is that I don''t care for the centered composition for this shot.  (No I''m not one of those people who hates all centered photos.)  Compositionally, I''m more interested in the space (or lack of) to the left of her than the emptiness behind her.  Still, it''s a small point for me.</td>', 'Great title for this image.  Good take on the challenge.  I like the B/W conversion.  My only CC really is that I don''t care for the centered composition for this shot.  (No I''m not one of those people who hates all centered photos.)  Compositionally, I''m more interested in the space (or lack of) to the left of her than the emptiness behind her.  Still, it''s a small point for me.', '2005-05-26 23:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415052, 180487, 1827, '<td valign="top">Neat effect, but it doesn''t do enough to make the subject interesting to me.  Good composition though and I like the border.</td>', 'Neat effect, but it doesn''t do enough to make the subject interesting to me.  Good composition though and I like the border.', '2005-05-26 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415053, 180615, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The way the light creates the suggestion of the benches makes this shot for me.</td>', 'Very nice.  The way the light creates the suggestion of the benches makes this shot for me.', '2005-05-26 23:47:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1415054, 180927, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice white balance.  (revised) I think maybe changing the composition so the break isn''t right down the middle would help.</td>', 'nice white balance.  (revised) I think maybe changing the composition so the break isn''t right down the middle would help.', '2005-05-26 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415057, 180451, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like the sunrays, as I generally tend to in photos, but the rest of the photos doesn''t excite me at all.  I don''t care for the branches in the foreground and I wish for some subject matter that was caught in the sunrays.  Even just a park bench, but I feel that something is needed as a focal point in the image.</td>', 'I like the sunrays, as I generally tend to in photos, but the rest of the photos doesn''t excite me at all.  I don''t care for the branches in the foreground and I wish for some subject matter that was caught in the sunrays.  Even just a park bench, but I feel that something is needed as a focal point in the image.', '2005-05-26 23:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415061, 180094, 37200, '<td valign="top">I find the background distracting from the portriate, maybe desaturating the background some as well would help.</td>', 'I find the background distracting from the portriate, maybe desaturating the background some as well would help.', '2005-05-26 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415082, 181005, 1827, '<td valign="top">The lighting is indeed very nice.  The "pose" and framing are also quite good.  Two little nitpicks: 1) the fuzzy head is clipped, but not enough to make it look intentional, and 2) the photo seems hazy  - this may be intentional, in which case please ignore the rest.  If it was inadvertant, there are two ways I can think to unhaze it: 1) boost saturation and contrast, or 2) defog with USM settings roughly 25/60/4.  HTH.</td>', 'The lighting is indeed very nice.  The "pose" and framing are also quite good.  Two little nitpicks: 1) the fuzzy head is clipped, but not enough to make it look intentional, and 2) the photo seems hazy  - this may be intentional, in which case please ignore the rest.  If it was inadvertant, there are two ways I can think to unhaze it: 1) boost saturation and contrast, or 2) defog with USM settings roughly 25/60/4.  HTH.', '2005-05-27 00:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415086, 180931, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual dimensions for this shot.  I like the fact that the mouth is cropped out as this is also unorthodox (and I imagine you''ll probably catch some flak for it).  I like the B/W/Sepia conversion.  The only thing that bugs me at all is the light on his left eyebrow - not that there is light there, but that it makes such a hard, straight, horizontal line.  Still, very well done. 7</td>', 'I like the unusual dimensions for this shot.  I like the fact that the mouth is cropped out as this is also unorthodox (and I imagine you''ll probably catch some flak for it).  I like the B/W/Sepia conversion.  The only thing that bugs me at all is the light on his left eyebrow - not that there is light there, but that it makes such a hard, straight, horizontal line.  Still, very well done. 7', '2005-05-27 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415090, 180258, 1827, '<td valign="top">The lighting is wonderful.  The composition is also quite nice - good use of the rule of thirds.  I would like to see the paws in the shot as well, and I think the mane suffers a bit from over-sharpening.</td>', 'The lighting is wonderful.  The composition is also quite nice - good use of the rule of thirds.  I would like to see the paws in the shot as well, and I think the mane suffers a bit from over-sharpening.', '2005-05-27 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415091, 180313, 1827, '<td valign="top">True to title, and for that reason, doomed not to score too well.</td>', 'True to title, and for that reason, doomed not to score too well.', '2005-05-27 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415092, 181032, 1827, '<td valign="top">Delightful.  Would like a little more breathing room left and bottom to let the tail be fully present in the shot and to incorporate a bit more of the dust in the back.  The lighting though is terrific. 7</td>', 'Delightful.  Would like a little more breathing room left and bottom to let the tail be fully present in the shot and to incorporate a bit more of the dust in the back.  The lighting though is terrific. 7', '2005-05-27 00:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415103, 180623, 1827, '<td valign="top">Different and interesting.</td>', 'Different and interesting.', '2005-05-27 00:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415108, 179845, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-05-27 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415110, 180523, 1827, '<td valign="top">Totally made me shutter.  Excellent use of light here.</td>', 'Totally made me shutter.  Excellent use of light here.', '2005-05-27 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415115, 180798, 1827, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  Completely not liking this at all.  Feels not innocent at all.  Borders on offensive to me.  Can''t put my finger on what it is, but somethign to do with the nudity, the age, the expression, and the ambigous white light she''s clutching.<br/> <br/>Technically, the lighting on her face and limbs is nice, but the white object mystifies me and seems out of place.</td>', 'Yikes.  Completely not liking this at all.  Feels not innocent at all.  Borders on offensive to me.  Can''t put my finger on what it is, but somethign to do with the nudity, the age, the expression, and the ambigous white light she''s clutching. Technically, the lighting on her face and limbs is nice, but the white object mystifies me and seems out of place.', '2005-05-27 00:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415145, 180289, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I wish I couldn''t see the stage lights at the top of the photo as it detracts from the intrigue for me.  Also, the guy hurts the shot a little bit for me.  I prefer to concentrate on the interesting shapes of the structure itself.  The guy''s pose seems too forced.</td>', 'Very interesting. I wish I couldn''t see the stage lights at the top of the photo as it detracts from the intrigue for me.  Also, the guy hurts the shot a little bit for me.  I prefer to concentrate on the interesting shapes of the structure itself.  The guy''s pose seems too forced.', '2005-05-27 00:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415158, 181012, 1827, '<td valign="top">Your model looks a bit like cameron diaz.  For me the lighting here is unfavorable.  The lighting on her face is too harsh creating shiny sweat spots, while the rest of her body falls into what appears to be unintentional shadow.</td>', 'Your model looks a bit like cameron diaz.  For me the lighting here is unfavorable.  The lighting on her face is too harsh creating shiny sweat spots, while the rest of her body falls into what appears to be unintentional shadow.', '2005-05-27 01:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415161, 181036, 1827, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The only nit is that I''d have cloned out the house lights in the trees.  Beautiful cloudscape.</td>', 'Lovely.  The only nit is that I''d have cloned out the house lights in the trees.  Beautiful cloudscape.', '2005-05-27 01:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415165, 180823, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very well lit.  I''d like a touch more space below the lowest earring.  I could also use a breath of space above the first girl''s hair.  If they''re meant to be sisters (they do bear a resemblence) then the sexuality is a turnoff and offensive to me.  If they''re meant to be lovers, I think it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'Very well lit.  I''d like a touch more space below the lowest earring.  I could also use a breath of space above the first girl''s hair.  If they''re meant to be sisters (they do bear a resemblence) then the sexuality is a turnoff and offensive to me.  If they''re meant to be lovers, I think it''s a very nice shot.', '2005-05-27 01:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415181, 180484, 1827, '<td valign="top">The directional lighting here is very effective and very well used.  I wish for a little more clarity in the eyes.  They have the appearance of being sharpened in post processing.  The hair and broom bristles also look a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'The directional lighting here is very effective and very well used.  I wish for a little more clarity in the eyes.  They have the appearance of being sharpened in post processing.  The hair and broom bristles also look a bit oversharpened to me.', '2005-05-27 01:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415185, 180579, 1827, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL.  Love the shadow play.</td>', 'WONDERFUL.  Love the shadow play.', '2005-05-27 01:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415195, 180530, 36956, '<td valign="top">a splendid photograph!</td>', 'a splendid photograph!', '2005-05-27 01:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415252, 180298, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is unique perspective for a common site that uses light to liven the photo.  Good job.</td>', 'This is unique perspective for a common site that uses light to liven the photo.  Good job.', '2005-05-27 02:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
