(1415491, 180759, 32948, '<td valign="top">where is the cross?  nice contrast, just think the bright white is a bit to bright or hot. think a change of fstop might have brought more definition to the whited area, they seem to want to show something.</td>', 'where is the cross?  nice contrast, just think the bright white is a bit to bright or hot. think a change of fstop might have brought more definition to the whited area, they seem to want to show something.', '2005-05-27 08:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
