(1415605, 179076, 27482, '<td valign="top">The frame is horrible and doesn´t do anything for me personally but detract attention from the photo.  That aside and trying to ignore the frame the shot is very nice and I love the lighting and the high key feel to it.  Especially like the tones and composition along with the soft focus in the image.  Ended up giving it an 8, good job.</td>', 'The frame is horrible and doesn´t do anything for me personally but detract attention from the photo.  That aside and trying to ignore the frame the shot is very nice and I love the lighting and the high key feel to it.  Especially like the tones and composition along with the soft focus in the image.  Ended up giving it an 8, good job.', '2005-05-27 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415610, 180862, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a bit confusing with no focal point that I can identify. The sharpness is a little off too.</td>', 'This is a bit confusing with no focal point that I can identify. The sharpness is a little off too.', '2005-05-27 10:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415611, 180714, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad as a postcard but subject is a bit overdone and I would probably be scoring this higher if this was the first time I saw this magnificent bridge.  I like this shot but it´s just very mundane and not exciting at all.  One question though, where are those starlights you are referring to with your title, I don´t see a single star in the sky?</td>', 'Not bad as a postcard but subject is a bit overdone and I would probably be scoring this higher if this was the first time I saw this magnificent bridge.  I like this shot but it´s just very mundane and not exciting at all.  One question though, where are those starlights you are referring to with your title, I don´t see a single star in the sky?', '2005-05-27 10:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
