(1415663, 180909, 27482, '<td valign="top">Now this is pretty cool, gotta love painting with light.  I gave it a 9, I love pretty much everything about it except 2 things.  The bottom leafs should either be in the frame or out of it, not half in as it is now and the big lights that have burned out highlights take too much attention but other than that, perfect.  I especially like the lines that make up the backround.</td>', 'Now this is pretty cool, gotta love painting with light.  I gave it a 9, I love pretty much everything about it except 2 things.  The bottom leafs should either be in the frame or out of it, not half in as it is now and the big lights that have burned out highlights take too much attention but other than that, perfect.  I especially like the lines that make up the backround.', '2005-05-27 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
