(1415712, 180889, 29797, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s the same one here, but I went to a Russian circus a couple months ago and there was a lady that looked just like her and doing the same thing. With that hair and outfit it has to be the same one. I was far away and didn''t have a nice lens at the time so I couldn''t get anything this nice. Really nice capture and composition here, and the exposure is spot on.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s the same one here, but I went to a Russian circus a couple months ago and there was a lady that looked just like her and doing the same thing. With that hair and outfit it has to be the same one. I was far away and didn''t have a nice lens at the time so I couldn''t get anything this nice. Really nice capture and composition here, and the exposure is spot on.', '2005-05-27 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
