(1415751, 179156, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool!  I am going to look this shot up after the challenge is over and see what lens you used for this one, the fisheye really makes this shot work.  Stil not a 10 from me though as it´s a little too "funky" for my taste and also I would have liked to see it darker but great creativity on your behalf.  Hope you do well in the challenge and I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Pretty cool!  I am going to look this shot up after the challenge is over and see what lens you used for this one, the fisheye really makes this shot work.  Stil not a 10 from me though as it´s a little too "funky" for my taste and also I would have liked to see it darker but great creativity on your behalf.  Hope you do well in the challenge and I gave it a 9.', '2005-05-27 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1415759, 179704, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool but it bugs me a little bit that you cut of the top and bottom that way, I would rather have wanted to see this perfectly symmetrical and in a 1:1 crop but I still like this shot a lot, especially the colour and simplicity of it.</td>', 'Pretty cool but it bugs me a little bit that you cut of the top and bottom that way, I would rather have wanted to see this perfectly symmetrical and in a 1:1 crop but I still like this shot a lot, especially the colour and simplicity of it.', '2005-05-27 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
