(1416696, 180999, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Great detail &amp; the blue neon is fantastic with the reflections.  I think you probably could have cropped out a little more on the sides to cut down on the "busy-ness" of the image, but that''s hardly anything to complain about.  Beautiful job.  (9)</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Great detail & the blue neon is fantastic with the reflections.  I think you probably could have cropped out a little more on the sides to cut down on the "busy-ness" of the image, but that''s hardly anything to complain about.  Beautiful job.  (9)', '2005-05-27 22:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416697, 179775, 20068, '<td valign="top">Great color and the DOF really works for me...especially with the smaller element, top and center.  Fine job.</td>', 'Great color and the DOF really works for me...especially with the smaller element, top and center.  Fine job.', '2005-05-27 22:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416700, 180289, 34659, '<td valign="top">LOVE this!  Great job.  The model  &amp; the old jukebox add a lot of character too.  The only thing holding it back from a 10 IMHO is that there is so much light it washes out the overall effectiveness of all the different light beams a little.  I still really like this one a lot though...  (9)</td>', 'LOVE this!  Great job.  The model  & the old jukebox add a lot of character too.  The only thing holding it back from a 10 IMHO is that there is so much light it washes out the overall effectiveness of all the different light beams a little.  I still really like this one a lot though...  (9)', '2005-05-27 22:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416701, 179849, 20068, '<td valign="top">I like the retro feel of this shot...the composition works well.  Normally, I would let a portion of the foreground globe penetrate the border, but this one, along with the last, running such a clean diagonal give this shot the precision it needs.</td>', 'I like the retro feel of this shot...the composition works well.  Normally, I would let a portion of the foreground globe penetrate the border, but this one, along with the last, running such a clean diagonal give this shot the precision it needs.', '2005-05-27 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416703, 180601, 20068, '<td valign="top">This has a sumptuous feel and the unusual focus gives it an otherworldliness that really works for the shot.</td>', 'This has a sumptuous feel and the unusual focus gives it an otherworldliness that really works for the shot.', '2005-05-27 22:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416704, 180215, 20068, '<td valign="top">Love the light rays.  Great surrealist shot.</td>', 'Love the light rays.  Great surrealist shot.', '2005-05-27 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416706, 179775, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job.  While I know that lighting plays an integral role in every shot, the lighting in this one seems to me (IMHO) to have had the opportunity to play an even bigger role - highlighting the photosynthesis/plant growth even more.  It almost looks too dark.  HOWEVER, it''s pretty insignificant when compared to the clarity and "moment in time" that you captured so beautifully.  (8)</td>', 'Beautiful job.  While I know that lighting plays an integral role in every shot, the lighting in this one seems to me (IMHO) to have had the opportunity to play an even bigger role - highlighting the photosynthesis/plant growth even more.  It almost looks too dark.  HOWEVER, it''s pretty insignificant when compared to the clarity and "moment in time" that you captured so beautifully.  (8)', '2005-05-27 22:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416708, 178704, 20068, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  The minimalist in me would have loved this shot with a pure, white curtain, but a nice, nice shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  The minimalist in me would have loved this shot with a pure, white curtain, but a nice, nice shot, nonetheless.', '2005-05-27 22:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416709, 180798, 34659, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal...  Beautiful...  Superb...  Definitely a contender for blue - it''s certainly my top pick.  (10)</td>', 'Phenomenal...  Beautiful...  Superb...  Definitely a contender for blue - it''s certainly my top pick.  (10)', '2005-05-27 22:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
