(1416711, 180975, 20068, '<td valign="top">A real sense of magic and mystery.  Love the rays from the sun.  The slightly muted colors work and wonder what the feeling would be with a bit more saturation...bet the whole mood changes.  Nice work.</td>', 'A real sense of magic and mystery.  Love the rays from the sun.  The slightly muted colors work and wonder what the feeling would be with a bit more saturation...bet the whole mood changes.  Nice work.', '2005-05-27 22:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416712, 180406, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like how the flower is literally "hanging" in mid-air.  Very nice lighting too - although it almost looks a little out of focus/not as crisp as it could be.  However, great job!  (8)</td>', 'I really like how the flower is literally "hanging" in mid-air.  Very nice lighting too - although it almost looks a little out of focus/not as crisp as it could be.  However, great job!  (8)', '2005-05-27 22:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416713, 178971, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool...  (8)</td>', 'Very, very cool...  (8)', '2005-05-27 22:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416720, 181015, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very nice job.  I really like it.  The only thing I would suggest is to make the ghost a little more transparent and less light on the face &amp; hair - it seems brighter than the light in the room, and I generally think of spirits or apparitions as being more opaque and dimly visible.  Again though - kudos for originality &amp; a great shot.  (7)</td>', 'Very nice job.  I really like it.  The only thing I would suggest is to make the ghost a little more transparent and less light on the face & hair - it seems brighter than the light in the room, and I generally think of spirits or apparitions as being more opaque and dimly visible.  Again though - kudos for originality & a great shot.  (7)', '2005-05-27 22:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416729, 180752, 20068, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I am always shooting theater signs...this is a great, simple shot.  Good job.</td>', 'For some reason, I am always shooting theater signs...this is a great, simple shot.  Good job.', '2005-05-27 22:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416731, 179778, 33924, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick of a challenge that has many amazing photographs. The lighting is such a beautiful part of the composition in your entry. The photo has such a soft feel, creating a very classic and romantic atmosphere. The repetition of thepillars and the rounded shafts of light, the shadows contrasted with the light, the way your eye follows the line down - all these things make for a very strong photo. Great job 10!</td>', 'This is my top pick of a challenge that has many amazing photographs. The lighting is such a beautiful part of the composition in your entry. The photo has such a soft feel, creating a very classic and romantic atmosphere. The repetition of thepillars and the rounded shafts of light, the shadows contrasted with the light, the way your eye follows the line down - all these things make for a very strong photo. Great job 10!', '2005-05-27 22:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416732, 180924, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, but I can''t really tell what it is.  I like the shape &amp; colors - and it''s bright, but is it a lamp or time lapse of the sky or someone twirling something?  I''d have scored it much higher I''m sure if I could have recognized something in it (i.e., a dimly lit or silhouette of the person twirling, or a faint tree, etc.).  Please don''t get me wrong - I love abstract stuff &amp; modern art - and I do really like this image, I just can''t get past not knowing what it is...  (6)</td>', 'This is really cool, but I can''t really tell what it is.  I like the shape & colors - and it''s bright, but is it a lamp or time lapse of the sky or someone twirling something?  I''d have scored it much higher I''m sure if I could have recognized something in it (i.e., a dimly lit or silhouette of the person twirling, or a faint tree, etc.).  Please don''t get me wrong - I love abstract stuff & modern art - and I do really like this image, I just can''t get past not knowing what it is...  (6)', '2005-05-27 22:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416734, 180289, 20068, '<td valign="top">This shot is, DRAMA.  The lighting that you were able to catch, with the sihlouette is just awesome.  I really like that you resisited cropping out the top stage lights.  Good choice.</td>', 'This shot is, DRAMA.  The lighting that you were able to catch, with the sihlouette is just awesome.  I really like that you resisited cropping out the top stage lights.  Good choice.', '2005-05-27 22:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416735, 179853, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect with the card reflection in the glasses.  I think maybe you could have cropped more from the top &amp; bottom to make the focus even more on the light reflection off the cards, but a very good idea and it''s well done.  (6)</td>', 'Very nice effect with the card reflection in the glasses.  I think maybe you could have cropped more from the top & bottom to make the focus even more on the light reflection off the cards, but a very good idea and it''s well done.  (6)', '2005-05-27 22:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416739, 179460, 33924, '<td valign="top">This is a very sensual photograph, with the details in the central part of the flower being so textured and the petals being so soft. The lines flow in such a beautiful way and the composition, placing the stamen where you did, is perfect. The light is so soft and contrasts in such a nice, gentle way with the shadows. I also love the matching green you chose for the border. Amazing!</td>', 'This is a very sensual photograph, with the details in the central part of the flower being so textured and the petals being so soft. The lines flow in such a beautiful way and the composition, placing the stamen where you did, is perfect. The light is so soft and contrasts in such a nice, gentle way with the shadows. I also love the matching green you chose for the border. Amazing!', '2005-05-27 22:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416750, 180812, 33924, '<td valign="top">A very beautifully shot photograph! I love the way the light and shadows fall on the clock face. Also, the choice of such a classic timepiece is excellent - serves to highlight your theme of the speed of time; I guess it''s actually the time of light, but light travels at a very quick speed, so I''m not so far off, right? I''m really curious how you created the lighting effects, especially the zooming effect in the background. The border makes it feel a bit like a postcard. Very, very nicely done!</td>', 'A very beautifully shot photograph! I love the way the light and shadows fall on the clock face. Also, the choice of such a classic timepiece is excellent - serves to highlight your theme of the speed of time; I guess it''s actually the time of light, but light travels at a very quick speed, so I''m not so far off, right? I''m really curious how you created the lighting effects, especially the zooming effect in the background. The border makes it feel a bit like a postcard. Very, very nicely done!', '2005-05-27 22:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416759, 180798, 33924, '<td valign="top">I love the way you used the lamp as a prop, making it into an object to see into the future with. The light it casts on the girl''s face and legs really creates a very mystical feeling. Also, the way the girl''s hands are silhouetted makes the oracle''s hands look bigger than the rest of her and creates a sense of power around her. Great use of light and shadow! Even the way the girl''s eyes aren''t looking down at the light, not looking at the camera, but looking, as if seeing something no one else is seeing, is excellent!</td>', 'I love the way you used the lamp as a prop, making it into an object to see into the future with. The light it casts on the girl''s face and legs really creates a very mystical feeling. Also, the way the girl''s hands are silhouetted makes the oracle''s hands look bigger than the rest of her and creates a sense of power around her. Great use of light and shadow! Even the way the girl''s eyes aren''t looking down at the light, not looking at the camera, but looking, as if seeing something no one else is seeing, is excellent!', '2005-05-27 22:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416794, 179704, 36309, '<td valign="top">A very interesting, captivating shot.  The border sets it off well.</td>', 'A very interesting, captivating shot.  The border sets it off well.', '2005-05-27 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416835, 180204, 6405, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light,10</td>', 'Excellent use of light,10', '2005-05-27 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1416839, 180258, 6405, '<td valign="top">Too much light.</td>', 'Too much light.', '2005-05-27 23:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
