(1416997, 180034, 34759, '<td valign="top">I love this one!  Great shot. I love the way the lighting sort of sneaks in around the corners in places.</td>', 'I love this one!  Great shot. I love the way the lighting sort of sneaks in around the corners in places.', '2005-05-28 01:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
