(1417286, 180299, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  Very sharp focal point.  Reflection of the surroundings in the bubble a bery nice point.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  Very sharp focal point.  Reflection of the surroundings in the bubble a bery nice point.', '2005-05-28 07:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417295, 179910, 30809, '<td valign="top">Exceptional</td>', 'Exceptional', '2005-05-28 07:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417299, 180258, 35161, '<td valign="top">He is so proud...nice capture of the lion king! :)<br/>It''s a pity that the fur is a bit burnt...</td>', 'He is so proud...nice capture of the lion king! :)It''s a pity that the fur is a bit burnt...', '2005-05-28 08:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417305, 181026, 38433, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-05-28 08:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417357, 180595, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess this isn''t scoring well, but I think its a really good shot.  The lighting is an important element in this shot because it provides the contrast that sets this apart from an ordinary wedding type shot.  The focus on the bride is excellent, and the fisheye look makes the shot more dynamic.  I would have cropped out the flash reflection on the left though.  I don''t think its necessary in order the meet the challenge, but feel it detracts attention from the bride.  Keep taking these kind of shots though, this definitely tells a story and does so in an artistic fashion.</td>', 'I''m gonna guess this isn''t scoring well, but I think its a really good shot.  The lighting is an important element in this shot because it provides the contrast that sets this apart from an ordinary wedding type shot.  The focus on the bride is excellent, and the fisheye look makes the shot more dynamic.  I would have cropped out the flash reflection on the left though.  I don''t think its necessary in order the meet the challenge, but feel it detracts attention from the bride.  Keep taking these kind of shots though, this definitely tells a story and does so in an artistic fashion.', '2005-05-28 10:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417428, 180756, 25024, '<td valign="top">Brave attempt, I know from experience this is not easy to achieve, (I gave up on mine!) but doesnt quite work for me. A different colour background may have helped - good luck</td>', 'Brave attempt, I know from experience this is not easy to achieve, (I gave up on mine!) but doesnt quite work for me. A different colour background may have helped - good luck', '2005-05-28 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417464, 180257, 38007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is. A marble?</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is. A marble?', '2005-05-28 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417466, 180526, 38007, '<td valign="top">very cool...what a mood this evokes. A tiny bit much on the catchlight...and maybe a little more detail of hand and neck or closer cropping...but maybe my monitor is showing too dark.</td>', 'very cool...what a mood this evokes. A tiny bit much on the catchlight...and maybe a little more detail of hand and neck or closer cropping...but maybe my monitor is showing too dark.', '2005-05-28 12:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417469, 180615, 38007, '<td valign="top">Gosh I really wish I could see a touch more more of the pews, some warmth of the wood.</td>', 'Gosh I really wish I could see a touch more more of the pews, some warmth of the wood.', '2005-05-28 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417473, 180623, 38007, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the opening looks blown out to me. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Unfortunately the opening looks blown out to me. Nice idea though.', '2005-05-28 12:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417492, 179156, 38375, '<td valign="top">I love the use of other colors, also a fan of wide angle distortion.</td>', 'I love the use of other colors, also a fan of wide angle distortion.', '2005-05-28 12:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417499, 180258, 38007, '<td valign="top">I think it is a little too sharp, and lost detail in the white of the muzzle...and then the too deep shadow in the eye. Without that unsharp mask would have been great but still very memorable.</td>', 'I think it is a little too sharp, and lost detail in the white of the muzzle...and then the too deep shadow in the eye. Without that unsharp mask would have been great but still very memorable.', '2005-05-28 12:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417566, 180862, 38007, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 3 becuase there really is no composition, the horizon isn''t level, and just overal confusion.</td>', 'I voted this a 3 becuase there really is no composition, the horizon isn''t level, and just overal confusion.', '2005-05-28 13:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417569, 179460, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great flower! WHat is it? Love the detail of the center, composition and the lighting. Very good control of all that white...could have been overpowering.</td>', 'Great flower! WHat is it? Love the detail of the center, composition and the lighting. Very good control of all that white...could have been overpowering.', '2005-05-28 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417576, 180917, 38007, '<td valign="top">I gave this a three becuase I don''t really see how it fits the theme.</td>', 'I gave this a three becuase I don''t really see how it fits the theme.', '2005-05-28 13:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417577, 180818, 38007, '<td valign="top">too much overexposure</td>', 'too much overexposure', '2005-05-28 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
