(1417583, 180398, 38007, '<td valign="top">Composition is ...well...just not there. If cropped tight from the right maybe the image would be stronger?</td>', 'Composition is ...well...just not there. If cropped tight from the right maybe the image would be stronger?', '2005-05-28 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
