(1417595, 180724, 38007, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the composition...and don''t see why the lighting was difficult. Stormy skis are great.</td>', 'I don''t get the composition...and don''t see why the lighting was difficult. Stormy skis are great.', '2005-05-28 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
