(1418063, 179853, 1827, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  In fact, makes me wonder if this is why I never win a hand of poker.  I son''t care for the border on the the sides.</td>', 'Clever idea.  In fact, makes me wonder if this is why I never win a hand of poker.  I son''t care for the border on the the sides.', '2005-05-28 21:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
