(1419081, 180106, 24642, '<td valign="top">So clear and in your face.  I really like this work and it has a resemblance to the works of a painter I admire whos name is Sigurður Árni Sigurðsson //www.listasafn.akureyri.is/listak0102/sigasig.htm</td>', 'So clear and in your face.  I really like this work and it has a resemblance to the works of a painter I admire whos name is Sigurður Árni Sigurðsson //www.listasafn.akureyri.is/listak0102/sigasig.htm', '2005-05-29 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
