(1419150, 180291, 19936, '<td valign="top">Pretty creative!  A little soft on the focus but I would guess that is what you meant.  Great use of light.</td>', 'Pretty creative!  A little soft on the focus but I would guess that is what you meant.  Great use of light.', '2005-05-29 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
