(1419355, 180313, 7485, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m missing something, because that is certainly not "flat" light in the traditional sence, in fact just the opposite. Also, why so small? 640 wide is small enough as is.</td>', 'I guess I''m missing something, because that is certainly not "flat" light in the traditional sence, in fact just the opposite. Also, why so small? 640 wide is small enough as is.', '2005-05-29 20:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419365, 179337, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, excellent composition and lighting, but the motion blur and over-sharpening ruins it for me (and the overkill frame doesn''t help either). I''d suggest you reshoot this until you get a tack-sharp one, you are very close to a superb photo here.</td>', 'Great idea, excellent composition and lighting, but the motion blur and over-sharpening ruins it for me (and the overkill frame doesn''t help either). I''d suggest you reshoot this until you get a tack-sharp one, you are very close to a superb photo here.', '2005-05-29 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419371, 179919, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and use of color, but the cut-off foot and plumbing equipment is too distracting</td>', 'Great lighting and use of color, but the cut-off foot and plumbing equipment is too distracting', '2005-05-29 20:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419399, 180298, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Wish I''d done it. I usually don''t like the angles, but it works here.</td>', 'Great shot! Wish I''d done it. I usually don''t like the angles, but it works here.', '2005-05-29 20:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419401, 180194, 2553, '<td valign="top">Sensational, wouldn''t change a thing about this.  Beautiful color, stunning clarity that almost makes you think you could reach out and touch the scarf, and compelling composition.  12.  OK, 10.</td>', 'Sensational, wouldn''t change a thing about this.  Beautiful color, stunning clarity that almost makes you think you could reach out and touch the scarf, and compelling composition.  12.  OK, 10.', '2005-05-29 20:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419404, 181017, 2553, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of White Sands, NM where I used to live. Wonderfully captured light and shadow, and love the nice, rich warm tones, but the very indistinct, hazy background of the mountains detracts somewhat from the overall feel for me.</td>', 'Makes me think of White Sands, NM where I used to live. Wonderfully captured light and shadow, and love the nice, rich warm tones, but the very indistinct, hazy background of the mountains detracts somewhat from the overall feel for me.', '2005-05-29 21:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419405, 181032, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful in capture, color, and composition.  One of my favs.  10</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful in capture, color, and composition.  One of my favs.  10', '2005-05-29 21:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419407, 180808, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this a lot.  It kind of makes my stomach clench up with nervousness.  Great lighting, form, texture and composition.  A most compelling shot that makes you want to know the story with this.</td>', 'Wow, I really like this a lot.  It kind of makes my stomach clench up with nervousness.  Great lighting, form, texture and composition.  A most compelling shot that makes you want to know the story with this.', '2005-05-29 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419409, 180291, 2553, '<td valign="top">This looks like a piece of artwork!  Quite interesting and definitely has that little something "unexpected" that makes it a compelling photo.</td>', 'This looks like a piece of artwork!  Quite interesting and definitely has that little something "unexpected" that makes it a compelling photo.', '2005-05-29 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419411, 180527, 2553, '<td valign="top">All I can say is, I sure hope you make this a print, because I want to hang it on my wall.  An amazing shot that took my breath away the moment I say it.  I''m not much for flower shots, overall, but this is truly a different flower shot.  LOVE IT!  10</td>', 'All I can say is, I sure hope you make this a print, because I want to hang it on my wall.  An amazing shot that took my breath away the moment I say it.  I''m not much for flower shots, overall, but this is truly a different flower shot.  LOVE IT!  10', '2005-05-29 21:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419414, 180206, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very, very bright, sassy and alive!  The composition on this just gives it that little extra spark of excitement that really draws the eyes in.</td>', 'Very, very bright, sassy and alive!  The composition on this just gives it that little extra spark of excitement that really draws the eyes in.', '2005-05-29 21:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419416, 179765, 2553, '<td valign="top">The combination of shapes and colors give this an interesting kind of abstraction that draws the eye.  I''m not sure about the "coloring" of the "contents" of the glass - it''s kind of ghostly-eerie looking, but in it''s own way adds to the the abstract feel.  The centered composition feels a bit static, but overall I find the photo interesting.</td>', 'The combination of shapes and colors give this an interesting kind of abstraction that draws the eye.  I''m not sure about the "coloring" of the "contents" of the glass - it''s kind of ghostly-eerie looking, but in it''s own way adds to the the abstract feel.  The centered composition feels a bit static, but overall I find the photo interesting.', '2005-05-29 21:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419418, 181026, 2553, '<td valign="top">Minimalism works here.  I''m a huge fan of negative space done right, and I love your use of it with this.</td>', 'Minimalism works here.  I''m a huge fan of negative space done right, and I love your use of it with this.', '2005-05-29 21:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419419, 179749, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like the "painterly" feel of this, it''s perfect for the scene.  This would be a great greeting card.  The composition, the light, the softness, the whole overall mood of this is just lovely.</td>', 'I really like the "painterly" feel of this, it''s perfect for the scene.  This would be a great greeting card.  The composition, the light, the softness, the whole overall mood of this is just lovely.', '2005-05-29 21:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419422, 180811, 2553, '<td valign="top">What really grabbed me with this was those lacy edges of the tree branches, and the beautiful transition of the light and color.  I can just barely make out the structures, but they add a depth to the photo that is great.  Quite an interesting shot.</td>', 'What really grabbed me with this was those lacy edges of the tree branches, and the beautiful transition of the light and color.  I can just barely make out the structures, but they add a depth to the photo that is great.  Quite an interesting shot.', '2005-05-29 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419425, 179951, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Shimmery highlights without hot  spots. Like the line of this simple composition. Bumping.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Shimmery highlights without hot  spots. Like the line of this simple composition. Bumping.', '2005-05-29 21:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419426, 179460, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the delicate and subtle nature of this photo. Beautiful. Top 10.</td>', 'I love the delicate and subtle nature of this photo. Beautiful. Top 10.', '2005-05-29 21:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419428, 180602, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot iimmediately made me want to ask all kinds of question.  The typical who, what, where, when, and why would just not be enough!  I want to know the whole story.  Are they running away?  Is it a volcano?  Are those waves crashing in the background? Or is it steam.  I will not rest until I know the whole story!<br/> <br/>VERY compelling shot in many ways.  The light situation is incredibly moody and mysterious.  The lone tree draws the eye towards it, as well as the dark figures, whose movement is apparent.  Great combination of lines, forms, textures, and light.</td>', 'This shot iimmediately made me want to ask all kinds of question.  The typical who, what, where, when, and why would just not be enough!  I want to know the whole story.  Are they running away?  Is it a volcano?  Are those waves crashing in the background? Or is it steam.  I will not rest until I know the whole story! VERY compelling shot in many ways.  The light situation is incredibly moody and mysterious.  The lone tree draws the eye towards it, as well as the dark figures, whose movement is apparent.  Great combination of lines, forms, textures, and light.', '2005-05-29 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419429, 179704, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative. Gorgeous, glowy light. Bumping.</td>', 'Creative. Gorgeous, glowy light. Bumping.', '2005-05-29 21:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419432, 180619, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture. Like the way the background light seems to glow.</td>', 'Very interesting capture. Like the way the background light seems to glow.', '2005-05-29 21:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419450, 180289, 30817, '<td valign="top">The ultimate in studio lighting!!  Nice touch to place the model in this shot. The band of darkness running behind his feet is not helpful, however.  Great light representation throughout.  8.</td>', 'The ultimate in studio lighting!!  Nice touch to place the model in this shot. The band of darkness running behind his feet is not helpful, however.  Great light representation throughout.  8.', '2005-05-29 21:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419474, 180451, 22734, '<td valign="top">The magic of daybreak.</td>', 'The magic of daybreak.', '2005-05-29 22:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419477, 180812, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is just lovely with great use of light.</td>', 'This image is just lovely with great use of light.', '2005-05-29 22:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419478, 180453, 22734, '<td valign="top">It is almost like a piece of poetry in pictures.</td>', 'It is almost like a piece of poetry in pictures.', '2005-05-29 22:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419480, 180937, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very creative presentation.</td>', 'Very creative presentation.', '2005-05-29 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419481, 179582, 22734, '<td valign="top">The great mysteries of nature enticing us. Beautiful.</td>', 'The great mysteries of nature enticing us. Beautiful.', '2005-05-29 22:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419482, 180618, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Great dramatic lighting.', '2005-05-29 22:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
