(1419953, 179778, 12253, '<td valign="top">I was starting to comment on this as I was bumping final scores and didn''t get to it--I started to feel guilty that I hadn''t finished my Beauty entry (and I missed the deadline anyway).  <br/> <br/>This was one of my top pics for the challenge.  I think you captured a wonderful scene, with great light.  I think you might have tried a little more contrast, on the black side,, and you might have scored better--I think your tones are probably about right, but online, and here at DPC, people vote higher for "pop"!  Likewise, cloning out the mark on the front beam might have gotten rid of a distraction.  Keep up the good work, it is, and will be, recognized.</td>', 'I was starting to comment on this as I was bumping final scores and didn''t get to it--I started to feel guilty that I hadn''t finished my Beauty entry (and I missed the deadline anyway).   This was one of my top pics for the challenge.  I think you captured a wonderful scene, with great light.  I think you might have tried a little more contrast, on the black side,, and you might have scored better--I think your tones are probably about right, but online, and here at DPC, people vote higher for "pop"!  Likewise, cloning out the mark on the front beam might have gotten rid of a distraction.  Keep up the good work, it is, and will be, recognized.', '2005-05-30 01:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
