(1420029, 178911, 93, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the only night I had available for this shoot turned out to be a damned hellishly windy night.<br/> <br/>I wasn''t pleased with this shot, or most of the shots I got from this shoot.. but got convinced to enter it last minute in place of another shot I had.. which I think would have done much, much better.<br/> <br/>Alas.  Not too concerned though. It placed higher than I expected, and my average didn''t suffer too much. lol.   My beauty shot is on course to finish about the same as this one too.  It seems that, even though I have a great camera, and can produce stunning photography on my own... when I''m forced to stick within confines of a challenge, I just can''t quite pull out of the "I''m going to be different on purpose MUWAHAHAH you bastards!" mentality that I seem to have.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the only night I had available for this shoot turned out to be a damned hellishly windy night. I wasn''t pleased with this shot, or most of the shots I got from this shoot.. but got convinced to enter it last minute in place of another shot I had.. which I think would have done much, much better. Alas.  Not too concerned though. It placed higher than I expected, and my average didn''t suffer too much. lol.   My beauty shot is on course to finish about the same as this one too.  It seems that, even though I have a great camera, and can produce stunning photography on my own... when I''m forced to stick within confines of a challenge, I just can''t quite pull out of the "I''m going to be different on purpose MUWAHAHAH you bastards!" mentality that I seem to have.', '2005-05-30 02:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
