(1420261, 180289, 24613, '<td valign="top">Your first ribbon!  Congrats!  This is such a creative shot that fits the challenge so well.  Hope to see more of your work in the winners circle!</td>', 'Your first ribbon!  Congrats!  This is such a creative shot that fits the challenge so well.  Hope to see more of your work in the winners circle!', '2005-05-30 05:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
