(1420295, 180289, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well done - not much wrong with this other than it''s beaten by some digital art.<br/> <br/>Edit: don''t go too heavy with Neat Image though, you''re starting to lose texture &amp; detail.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-30 05:11:57.</i></td>', 'Well done - not much wrong with this other than it''s beaten by some digital art. Edit: don''t go too heavy with Neat Image though, you''re starting to lose texture & detail.', '2005-05-30 06:10:58.000000', '2005-05-30 06:11:57.000000', 0),
(1420308, 180498, 26679, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Beeeeeautiful shot, Dr. P.J.!!!!!!    I absolutely love the colors and sharpness.  Congratulations on such a strong finish!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Peter I go with SandyP on this one...<br/>Congrats</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Beeeeeautiful shot, Dr. P.J.!!!!!!    I absolutely love the colors and sharpness.  Congratulations on such a strong finish!!   Peter I go with SandyP on this one...Congrats', '2005-05-30 06:23:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420314, 180034, 27845, '<td valign="top">A lovely photograph. I find your description very interesting. And, slowly  I begin to recognize your style before I see your name. And I like that style.</td>', 'A lovely photograph. I find your description very interesting. And, slowly  I begin to recognize your style before I see your name. And I like that style.', '2005-05-30 06:27:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420324, 180798, 7810, '<td valign="top">Had this at number 1  great shot  congrats on top 5</td>', 'Had this at number 1  great shot  congrats on top 5', '2005-05-30 06:34:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420335, 180602, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great shot Heiða, this is by far the best picture I have seen of the withered grass burning. Lets just hope that there will not be more of them though. The lightning is great, it is playing with the smoke on the scene and the men, and by that giving the extra touch good that makes this picture great. I am not sure that everyone understands exactly what it is about but it could mirror so many things that it really doesn''t matter. Your photography continues to make us - your fellow countrymen - really proud.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-30 05:51:52.</i></td>', 'Great shot Heiða, this is by far the best picture I have seen of the withered grass burning. Lets just hope that there will not be more of them though. The lightning is great, it is playing with the smoke on the scene and the men, and by that giving the extra touch good that makes this picture great. I am not sure that everyone understands exactly what it is about but it could mirror so many things that it really doesn''t matter. Your photography continues to make us - your fellow countrymen - really proud.', '2005-05-30 06:50:15.000000', '2005-05-30 06:51:52.000000', 0),
(1420343, 180289, 23456, '<td valign="top">A striking Image ! Well Done !</td>', 'A striking Image ! Well Done !', '2005-05-30 06:57:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420345, 180289, 15810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deserved ribbon<br/> <br/>Superb shot<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'Congrats on your well deserved ribbon Superb shot Steve', '2005-05-30 06:58:52.000000', NULL, 0);
