(1420396, 180289, 18080, '<td valign="top">WOO HOO<br/>My First ribbon.<br/>Do i retire now?<br/>Thanks guys for all the wonderful comments.<br/>Was hoping for a top 5<br/>third, i''m over the moon.<br/>THANK YOU.<br/>Third best in the entire world at taking photographs...<br/>LOL<br/>Now on to the next ribbon.<br/>Kev</td>', 'WOO HOOMy First ribbon.Do i retire now?Thanks guys for all the wonderful comments.Was hoping for a top 5third, i''m over the moon.THANK YOU.Third best in the entire world at taking photographs...LOLNow on to the next ribbon.Kev', '2005-05-30 07:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
