(1420534, 180094, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find this image fascinating.  I think the background adds and I like the lighting.  It reminds me of "Agnes of God." Very unsettling which I like. Underrated - extremely.  And I think it would do well outside DPC.  Sorry no one else saw it this way.</td>', 'I find this image fascinating.  I think the background adds and I like the lighting.  It reminds me of "Agnes of God." Very unsettling which I like. Underrated - extremely.  And I think it would do well outside DPC.  Sorry no one else saw it this way.', '2005-05-30 09:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
