(1420610, 179801, 14386, '<td valign="top">Leslie...you''re turning to be a pro.  With the speed fo your improvement in the last challenges, I can see you UP there in the pedestal soon enough.  You are great!<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'Leslie...you''re turning to be a pro.  With the speed fo your improvement in the last challenges, I can see you UP there in the pedestal soon enough.  You are great! Manny', '2005-05-30 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420623, 180194, 14386, '<td valign="top">I am flattered to have inspired you to take this shot.  tHis is beautiful.  I like the slight opening of the mouth....more expressive.  I also like the fact that the transparent veil covers the whole face.  How you''ve managed to achieved sharpness despite the veil covering is amazing.  Any trick?<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'I am flattered to have inspired you to take this shot.  tHis is beautiful.  I like the slight opening of the mouth....more expressive.  I also like the fact that the transparent veil covers the whole face.  How you''ve managed to achieved sharpness despite the veil covering is amazing.  Any trick? Manny', '2005-05-30 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420624, 180602, 37005, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your blue!  Great job.</td>', 'Congrats on your blue!  Great job.', '2005-05-30 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420631, 180707, 36981, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, and I was amazed when I read how you did it.  I''ll have to try this myself, but I suspect that you make it sound easier than it is!  Congratulations on a great photo; I''ve added it to my favorites.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, and I was amazed when I read how you did it.  I''ll have to try this myself, but I suspect that you make it sound easier than it is!  Congratulations on a great photo; I''ve added it to my favorites.', '2005-05-30 11:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420713, 180686, 34247, '<td valign="top">Since you asked on the thread...I gave this a 7, but primarily on the strength of your attempt. I liked the idea. For it to have been more effective for me, I''d have wanted a more striking difference between the water stream and the water in the jar. Lighting shifts could have emphasized this more. The overall image is also quite dark, and I felt the mood would have benefited from a different lighting set up. But like I said, I was one of your 13 7s, so I did like this enough.</td>', 'Since you asked on the thread...I gave this a 7, but primarily on the strength of your attempt. I liked the idea. For it to have been more effective for me, I''d have wanted a more striking difference between the water stream and the water in the jar. Lighting shifts could have emphasized this more. The overall image is also quite dark, and I felt the mood would have benefited from a different lighting set up. But like I said, I was one of your 13 7s, so I did like this enough.', '2005-05-30 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420728, 178936, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great work! and thanks for posting the info in your photographer''s comments. It''s appreciated.</td>', 'Great work! and thanks for posting the info in your photographer''s comments. It''s appreciated.', '2005-05-30 12:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420741, 180289, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well worth all the effort Kev.<br/>Superb shot.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Well worth all the effort Kev.Superb shot.Congratulations.', '2005-05-30 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420749, 180602, 14603, '<td valign="top">No mistaking where this shot originated.Very eyecatching stuff.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'No mistaking where this shot originated.Very eyecatching stuff.Congratulations.', '2005-05-30 12:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1420751, 180811, 33947, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everybody for the great comments and scores. You made my day!</td>', 'Thanks to everybody for the great comments and scores. You made my day!', '2005-05-30 12:30:37.000000', NULL, 0),
