(1500715, 180527, 17203, '<td valign="top">Where was this hiding? Great shot for the challenge, but strange that I never saw it before. Love the intense color and rich contrast. As you suspected, a little more DOF might have made the difference between 9th and another patch o'' color by your name. It''s hard to feel sorry for a 6.5 though- congrats!</td>', 'Where was this hiding? Great shot for the challenge, but strange that I never saw it before. Love the intense color and rich contrast. As you suspected, a little more DOF might have made the difference between 9th and another patch o'' color by your name. It''s hard to feel sorry for a 6.5 though- congrats!', '2005-07-02 22:52:10.000000', NULL, 0),
